#. i18n: ectx: property (toolTip), widget (QRadioButton, m_sortHorizontal)
#: dialogs/SortWidget.ui:128
msgid ""
"The data is grouped in columns and gets sorted horizontally by comparing the "
"specified rows in the given order."
