msgid "Boolean value"
msgstr "Bulova vrijednost"

#: functions/logic.xml:190
msgid ""
"The NOT() function returns True if the value is False and returns False if "
"the value is True. It returns an error if the input in an error."
msgstr ""
"NOT() funkcija vraća Tačno ako je vrijednost netačna i vraća Netačno ako je "
"vrijednost Tačna.Vraća grešku ako je ulazna jedinica pogrešna."

#: functions/logic.xml:191
msgid "NOT(bool)"
msgstr "NOT(logička)"

#: functions/logic.xml:192
msgid "NOT(false) returns True"
msgstr "NOT(false) vraća Tačno"

#: functions/logic.xml:193
msgid "NOT(true) returns False"
msgstr "NOT(truje) vraća Netačno"

#: functions/logic.xml:201
msgid "Condition"
msgstr "Uvjet"

#: functions/logic.xml:205
msgid "If true"
msgstr "if true"

#: functions/logic.xml:209
msgid "If false"
msgstr "if false"

#: functions/logic.xml:213
msgid ""
"The IF() function is a conditional function. This function returns the "
"second parameter if the condition is True. Otherwise it returns the third "
"parameter (which defaults to being false)."
msgstr ""
"IF() funkcija je uslovna funkcija.Ova funkcija vraća drugi parametar ako je "
"uslov Tačan.Inače vraća treći parametar(koji je zadan da bude netačan)."

#: functions/logic.xml:214
msgid "IF(condition;if_true;if_false)"
msgstr "IF(uslov;ako_je_tačno;ako_je_netačno)"

#: functions/logic.xml:215
msgid "A1=4;A2=6;IF(A1>A2;5;3) returns 3"
msgstr "A1=4;A2=6;IF(A1>A2;5;3) vraća 3"

#: functions/logic.xml:223 functions/logic.xml:241
msgid "Any X"
msgstr "Bilo koje X"

#: functions/logic.xml:227 functions/logic.xml:245
msgid "Any Alternative"
msgstr "Svaka alternativa"

#: functions/logic.xml:231
msgid ""
"Return X unless it is an Error, in which case return an alternative value."
msgstr "Vraća X osim ako je greška, u kom slučaju vraća drugu vrijednost"

#: functions/logic.xml:232
msgid "IFERROR(AnyX;AnyAlternative)"
msgstr "IFERROR(NekoX;NekaAlternativa)"

#: functions/logic.xml:233
msgid ""
"IFERROR(A1;A2) returns the content of A1 if that content is not an error-"
"value else the content of A2 is returned."
msgstr ""
"IFERROR(A1;A2) vraća sadržaj A1 ako taj sadržaj nije pogrešna vrijednost, "
"inače se vraća vrijednost A2."

#: functions/logic.xml:249
msgid "Return X unless it is an NA, in which case return an alternative value."
msgstr "Vraća X osim ako je NA, u kom slučaju vraća drugu vrijednost"

#: functions/logic.xml:250
msgid "IFNA(AnyX;AnyAlternative)"
msgstr "IFNA(NekoX;NekaAlternativa)"

#: functions/logic.xml:251
msgid ""
"IFNA(A1;A2) returns the content of A1 if that content is not an #N/A error-"
"value else the content of A2 is returned."
msgstr ""
"IFNA(A1;A2) vraća sadržaj A1 ako taj sadržaj nije pogrešna vrijednost #N/A, "
"inače se vraća vrijednost A2."

#: functions/math.xml:5
msgid "Math"
msgstr "Matematika"

#: functions/math.xml:19
msgid ""
"The SUBTOTAL() function returns a subtotal of a given list of arguments "
"ignoring other subtotal results in there. Function can be one of the "
"following numbers: 1 - Average, 2 - Count, 3 - CountA, 4 - Max, 5 - Min, 6 - "
"Product, 7 - StDev, 8 - StDevP, 9 - Sum, 10 - Var, 11 - VarP."
msgstr ""
"Funkcija SUBTOTAL() vraća obradu date liste argumenata, ignorišući druge "
"obradne rezultate u njoj. Funkcija može biti jedan od sljedećih brojeva: 1 - "
"prosjek, 2 - broj, 3 - brojA, 4 - maks., 5 - min., 6 - proizvod, 7 - st."
"div., 8 - st.div.P, 9 - suma, 10 - var., 11 - var.P."

#: functions/math.xml:20
msgid "SUBTOTAL(function; value)"
msgstr "SUBTOTAL(funkcija; vrijednost)"

#: functions/math.xml:21
msgid "If A1:A5 contains 7, 24, 23, 56 and 9:"
msgstr "Ako A1:A5 sadrži 7, 24, 23, 56 i 9:"

#: functions/math.xml:22
msgid "SUBTOTAL(1; A1:A5) returns 23.8"
msgstr "SUBTOTAL(1; A1:A5) vraća 23.8"

#: functions/math.xml:23
msgid "SUBTOTAL(4; A1:A5) returns 56"
msgstr "SUBTOTAL(4; A1:A5) vraća 56"

#: functions/math.xml:24
msgid "SUBTOTAL(9; A1:A5) returns 119"
msgstr "SUBTOTAL(9; A1:A5) vraća 119"

#: functions/math.xml:25
msgid "SUBTOTAL(11; A1:A5) returns 307.76"
msgstr "SUBTOTAL(11; A1:A5) vraća 307.76"

#: functions/math.xml:44
msgid "X the independent variable of the power series"
msgstr "X je nezavisna varijabla od snage serije"

#: functions/math.xml:48
msgid "N the initial power to which X is to be raised"
msgstr "N početna snaga kojom je X podignuto."

#: functions/math.xml:52
msgid "M the increment by which to increase N for each term in the series"
msgstr "M je prirast za koji se povećava N za svaki član u nizu."

#: functions/math.xml:56
msgid ""
"Coefficients a set of coefficients by which each successive power of the "
"variable X is multiplied"
msgstr "Koeficijenti grupe koeficijenata koji umnožavaju moć varijable X."

#: functions/math.xml:60
msgid "The SERIESSUM() function returns the sum of a power series."
msgstr "SERIESSUM() funkcija vraća sumu snaga serije."

#: functions/math.xml:61
msgid "SERIESSUM( X; N; M; Coefficients)"
msgstr "SERIESSUM( X; N; M; Koeficijenti)"

#: functions/math.xml:62
msgid "SERIESSUM(2;0;2;{1;2}) return 9"
msgstr "SERIESSUM(2;0;2;{1;2}) vraća 9"

#: functions/math.xml:79
msgid ""
"The LCM() function returns the least common multiple for two or more float "
"values"
msgstr ""
"Funkcija LCM() vraća najmanji zajednički sadržalac za dva ili više relnih "
"brojeva"

#: functions/math.xml:80
msgid "LCM(value; value)"
msgstr "LCM(vrijednost; vrijednost)"

#: functions/math.xml:81
msgid "LCM(6;4) returns 12"
msgstr "LCM(6;4) vraća 12"

#: functions/math.xml:82
msgid "LCM(1.5;2.25) returns 4.5"
msgstr "LCM(1.5;2.25) vraća 4.5"

#: functions/math.xml:83
msgid "LCM(2;3;4) returns 12"
msgstr "LCM(2;3;4) vraća 12"

#: functions/math.xml:100
msgid "Third number"
msgstr "Treći broj"

#: functions/math.xml:104
msgid ""
"The GCD() function returns the greatest common denominator for two or more "
"integer values."
msgstr ""
"Funkcija GCD() vraća najveći zajednički djelilac za dva ili više cijelih "
"brojeva."

#: functions/math.xml:105
msgid "GCD(value; value)"
msgstr "GCD(vrijednost; vrijednost)"

#: functions/math.xml:106
msgid "GCD(6;4) returns 2"
msgstr "GCD(6;4) vraća 2"

#: functions/math.xml:107
msgid "GCD(10;20) returns 10"
msgstr "GCD(10;20) vraća 10"

#: functions/math.xml:108
msgid "GCD(20;15;10) returns 5"
msgstr "GCD(20;15;10) vraća 5"

#: functions/math.xml:117
msgid ""
"EPS() returns the machine epsilon; this is the difference between 1 and the "
"next largest floating-point number. Because computers use a finite number of "
"digits, roundoff error is inherent (but usually insignificant) in all "
"calculations."
msgstr ""
"Funkcija EPS() vraća „mašinski epsilon“; ovo je razlika između 1 i sljedećeg "
"najvećeg broja u pokretnom zarezu. Pošto računari koriste konačan broj "
"cifara, u svim proračunima se pojavlju izvjesna (mada obično beznačajna) "
"greška zaokruživanja."

#: functions/math.xml:118
msgid "EPS()"
msgstr "EPS()"

#: functions/math.xml:119
msgid "On most systems, this returns 2^-52=2.2204460492503131e-16"
msgstr "Na većini sistema, ovo vraća 2^-52=2.2204460492503131e-16"

#: functions/math.xml:120
msgid ""
"0.5*EPS() returns the \"unit round\"; this value is interesting because it "
"is the largest number x where (1+x)-1=0 (due to roundoff errors)."
msgstr ""
"0.5*EPS() vraća „jedinicu zaokruživanja“; ova vrijednost je interesantna "
"zato što predstavlja najveći broj x za koji važi (1+x)-1=0 (zbog grešaka pri "
"zaokruživanju)."

#: functions/math.xml:121
msgid "EPS() is so small that Calligra Sheets displays 1+eps() as 1"
msgstr "EPS() je toliko mali da Calligra Sheets prikaže 1+eps() kao 1"

#: functions/math.xml:122
msgid ""
"Pick a number x between 0 and EPS(). Observe that 1+x rounds x to either 0 "
"or EPS() by using the equation (1+x)-1"
msgstr ""
"Izaberite broj x između 0 i EPS(). Primijetite da 1+x zaokružuje x ili na 0 "
"ili na EPS() pomoću izraza (1+x)-1"

#: functions/math.xml:138
msgid ""
"The POWER(x;y) function returns the value of x raised to the power of y."
msgstr "Funkcija POWER(x;y) vraća vrijednost x podignutu na stepen y."

#: functions/math.xml:139
msgid "POWER(value;value)"
msgstr "POWER(vrijednost;vrijednost)"

#: functions/math.xml:140
msgid "POWER(1.2;3.4) equals 1.8572"
msgstr "POWER(1.2;3.4) jednak je 1.8572"

#: functions/math.xml:141
msgid "POWER(2;3) equals 8"
msgstr "POWER(2;3) je 8"

#: functions/math.xml:158
msgid ""
"The POW(x;y) function returns the value of x raised to the power of y. It's "
"the same as POWER."
msgstr ""
"Funkcija POW(x;y) vraća vrijednost x podignutu na stepen y. Isto kao "
"funkcija POWER."

#: functions/math.xml:159
msgid "POW(value;value)"
msgstr "POW(vrijednost;vrijednost)"

#: functions/math.xml:160
msgid "POW(1.2;3.4) equals 1.8572"
msgstr "POW(1.2;3.4) je 1.8572"

#: functions/math.xml:161
msgid "POW(2;3) equals 8"
msgstr "POW(2;3) je 8"

#: functions/math.xml:174
msgid ""
"The EVEN() function returns the number rounded up to the nearest even "
"integer."
msgstr "Funkcija EVEN() vraća broj zaokružen na najbliži paran broj."

#: functions/math.xml:175
msgid "EVEN(value)"
msgstr "EVEN(vrijednost)"

#: functions/math.xml:176
msgid "EVEN(1.2) returns 2"
msgstr "EVEN(1.2) vraća 2"

#: functions/math.xml:177
msgid "EVEN(2) returns 2"
msgstr "EVEN(2) vraća 2"

#: functions/math.xml:190
msgid "Precision"
msgstr "Preciznost"

#: functions/math.xml:194
msgid ""
"The TRUNC() function truncates a numeric value to a certain precision. If "
"the precision is omitted 0 is assumed."
msgstr ""
"Funkcija TRUNC() odbacuje decimale numeričke vrijednost do zadate tačnosti. "
"Ako se tačnost ne navede, pretpostavlja se 0."

#: functions/math.xml:195
msgid "TRUNC(value; precision)"
msgstr "TRUNC(vrijednost; tačnost)"

#: functions/math.xml:196
msgid "TRUNC(1.2) returns 1"
msgstr "TRUNC(1.2) vraća 1"

#: functions/math.xml:197
msgid "TRUNC(213.232; 2) returns 213.23"
msgstr "TRUNC(213.232; 2) vraća 213.23"

#: functions/math.xml:212
msgid ""
"The ODD() function returns the number rounded up (or down, for negative "
"values) to the nearest odd integer. By definition, ODD(0) is 1."
msgstr ""
"ODD() funkcija vraća zaokružen broj ( ili donje za negativne vrijednosti) na "
"najbliži neparni cijeli broj. Po definiciji,ODD(0) je 1."

#: functions/math.xml:213
msgid "ODD(value)"
msgstr "ODD(vrijednost)"

#: functions/math.xml:214
msgid "ODD(1.2) returns 3"
msgstr "ODD(1.2) vraća 3"

#: functions/math.xml:215
msgid "ODD(2) returns 3"
msgstr "ODD(2) vraća 3"

#: functions/math.xml:216
msgid "ODD(-2) returns -3"
msgstr "ODD(-2) vraća -3"

#: functions/math.xml:229
msgid "The GAMMA() function returns the gamma function value."
msgstr "GAMMA() funkcija vraća vrijednost gamma funkcije."

#: functions/math.xml:230
msgid "GAMMA(value)"
msgstr "GAMMA(vrijednost)"

#: functions/math.xml:231
msgid "GAMMA(1) returns 1"
msgstr "GAMMA(1) vraća 1"

#: functions/math.xml:248
msgid ""
"The MOD() function returns the remainder after division. If the second "
"parameter is null the function returns #DIV/0."
msgstr ""
"Funkcija MOD() vraća ostatak pri dijeljenju. Ako je drugi parametar nula, "
"funkcija vraća #DIV/0."

#: functions/math.xml:249
msgid "MOD(value;value)"
msgstr "MOD(vrijednost;vrijednost)"

#: functions/math.xml:250
msgid "MOD(12;5) returns 2"
msgstr "MOD(12;5) vraća 2"

#: functions/math.xml:251
msgid "MOD(5;5) returns 0"
msgstr "MOD(5;5) vraća 0"

#: functions/math.xml:264
msgid ""
"This function returns -1 if the number is negative, 0 if the number is null "
"and 1 if the number is positive."
msgstr ""
"Ova funkcija vraća -1 ako je broj negativan, 0 ako je broj nula, i 1 ako je "
"broj pozitivan."

#: functions/math.xml:265
msgid "SIGN(value)"
msgstr "SIGN(vrijednost)"

#: functions/math.xml:266
msgid "SIGN(5) equals 1"
msgstr "SIGN(5) je 1"

#: functions/math.xml:267
msgid "SIGN(0) equals 0"
msgstr "SIGN(0) je 0"

#: functions/math.xml:268
msgid "SIGN(-5) equals -1"
msgstr "SIGN(-5) je -1"

#: functions/math.xml:280
msgid "This function multiplies each value by -1."
msgstr "Ova funkcija množi svaku vrijednost sa -1."

#: functions/math.xml:281
msgid "INV(value)"
msgstr "INV(vrijednost)"

#: functions/math.xml:282
msgid "INV(-5) equals 5"
msgstr "INV(-5) je 5"

#: functions/math.xml:283
msgid "INV(5) equals -5"
msgstr "INV(5) je -5"

#: functions/math.xml:284
msgid "INV(0) equals 0"
msgstr "INV(0) je 0"

#: functions/math.xml:296
msgid ""
"This function returns the count of integer or floating arguments passed. You "
"can count using a range: COUNT(A1:B5) or using a list of values like COUNT"
"(12;5;12.5)."
msgstr ""
"Ova funkcija vraća broj proslijeđenih cijelih ili realnih brojeva. Možete "
"brojati koristeći opseg, kao COUNT(A1:B5), ili koristeći listu vrijednosti, "
"kao COUNT(12;5;12.5)."

#: functions/math.xml:297
msgid "COUNT(value;value;value...)"
msgstr "COUNT(vrijednost;vrijednost;vrijednost;...)"

#: functions/math.xml:298
msgid "COUNT(-5;\"KSpread\";2) returns 2"
msgstr "COUNT(-5;\"KSpread\";2) vraća 2"

#: functions/math.xml:299
msgid "COUNT(5) returns 1"
msgstr "COUNT(5) vraća 1"

#: functions/math.xml:314
msgid ""
"This function returns the count of all non empty arguments passed. You can "
"count using a range: COUNTA(A1:B5) or using a list of values like COUNTA"
"(12;5;12.5)."
msgstr ""
"Ova funkcija vraća broj proslijeđenih nepraznih argumenata. Možete brojati "
"koristeći opseg, kao COUNTA(A1:B5), ili koristeći listu vrijednosti, kao "
"COUNTA(12;5;12.5)."

#: functions/math.xml:315
msgid "COUNTA(value;value;value...)"
msgstr "COUNTA(vrijednost;vrijednost;vrijednost;...)"

#: functions/math.xml:316
msgid "COUNTA(-5;\"KSpread\";2) returns 3"
msgstr "COUNTA(-5;\"KSpread\";2) vraća 3"

#: functions/math.xml:317
msgid "COUNTA(5) returns 1"
msgstr "COUNTA(5) vraća 1"

#: functions/math.xml:327
msgid "Cell range"
msgstr "Opseg ćelija"

#: functions/math.xml:331
msgid "This function returns the count of all empty cells within the range."
msgstr "Ova funkcija vraća broj svih praznih ćelija unutar opsega."

#: functions/math.xml:332
msgid "COUNTBLANK(range)"
msgstr "COUNTBLANK(opseg)"

#: functions/math.xml:333
msgid "COUNTBLANK(A1:B5)"
msgstr "COUNTBLANK(A1:B5)"

#: functions/math.xml:344 functions/math.xml:1209
msgid "Range"
msgstr "Opseg"

#: functions/math.xml:348 functions/math.xml:433
msgid "Criteria"
msgstr "Kriterijum"

#: functions/math.xml:352
msgid ""
"The COUNTIF() function returns the number of cells in the given range that "
"meet the given criteria."
msgstr ""
"Funkcija COUNTIF() vraća broj ćelija u datom opsegu koje zadovoljavaju dati "
"kriterijum."

#: functions/math.xml:353
msgid "COUNTIF(range;criteria)"
msgstr "COUNTIF(opseg;kriterijum)"

#: functions/math.xml:354
msgid "COUNTIF(A2:A3;\"14\") returns 1 if A2 is -4 and A3 is 14"
msgstr "COUNTIF(A2:A3;\"14\") vraća 1 ako je A2  -4 i A3 je 14"

#: functions/math.xml:364 functions/math.xml:379 functions/math.xml:654
#: functions/math.xml:670 functions/math.xml:684 functions/math.xml:702
#: functions/math.xml:725 functions/math.xml:744 functions/math.xml:797
#: functions/math.xml:816 functions/math.xml:832 functions/math.xml:849
#: functions/math.xml:876 functions/math.xml:910 functions/math.xml:925
#: functions/math.xml:973 functions/math.xml:1032
msgid "A floating point value"
msgstr "Realna vrijednost"

#: functions/math.xml:368
msgid ""
"The FACT() function calculates the factorial of the parameter. The "
"mathematical expression is (value)!."
msgstr ""
"Funkcija FACT() računa faktorijel parametra. Matematiki izraz je "
"(vrijednost)!."

#: functions/math.xml:369
msgid "FACT(number)"
msgstr "FACT(broj)"

#: functions/math.xml:370
msgid "FACT(10) returns 3628800"
msgstr "FACT(10) vraća 3628800"

#: functions/math.xml:371
msgid "FACT(0) returns 1"
msgstr "FACT(0) vraća 1"

#: functions/math.xml:383
msgid ""
"The FACTDOUBLE() function calculates the double factorial of a number, i.e. "
"x!!."
msgstr "Funkcija FACTDOUBLE() računa dvostruki faktorijel broja, tj. x!!."

#: functions/math.xml:384
msgid "FACTDOUBLE(number)"
msgstr "FACTDOUBLE(broj)"

#: functions/math.xml:385
msgid "FACTDOUBLE(6) returns 48"
msgstr "FACTDOUBLE(6) vraća 48"

#: functions/math.xml:386
msgid "FACTDOUBLE(7) returns 105"
msgstr "FACTDOUBLE(7) vraća 105"

#: functions/math.xml:398
msgid ""
"The SUM() function calculates the sum of all the values given as parameters. "
"You can calculate the sum of a range SUM(A1:B5) or a list of values like SUM"
"(12;5;12.5)."
msgstr ""
"Funkcija SUM() računa sumu svih vrijednosti datih kao parametri. Možete "
"računati sumu opsega, kao SUM(A1:B5), ili sumu liste vrijednosti, kao SUM"
"(12;5;12.5)."

#: functions/math.xml:399 functions/math.xml:417
msgid "SUM(value;value;...)"
msgstr "SUM(vrijednost;vrijednost;...)"

#: functions/math.xml:400
msgid "SUM(12;5;7) equals 24"
msgstr "SUM(12;5;7) je 24"

#: functions/math.xml:401
msgid "SUM(12.5;2) equals 14.5"
msgstr "SUM(12.5;2) je 14.5"

#: functions/math.xml:416
msgid ""
"The SUMA() function calculates the sum of all the values given as "
"parameters. You can calculate the sum of a range SUMA(A1:B5) or a list of "
"values like SUMA(12;5;12.5). If a parameter contains text or the boolean "
"value FALSE it is counted as 0, if a parameter evaluates to TRUE it is "
"counted as 1."
msgstr ""
"Funkcija SUMA() računa sumu svih vrijednosti datih kao parametri. Možete "
"računati sumu opsega, kao SUM(A1:B5), ili sumu liste vrijednosti, kao SUM"
"(12;5;12.5). Ako parametar sadrži logičko Netačno računaće se kao 0, a ako "
"sadrži Tačno računaće se kao 1."

#: functions/math.xml:418
msgid "SUMA(12;5; 7) equals 24"
msgstr "SUMA(12;5; 7) je 24"

#: functions/math.xml:419
msgid "SUMA(12.5; 2; TRUE) equals 15.5"
msgstr "SUMA(12.5; 2; TRUE) je 15.5"

#: functions/math.xml:429
msgid "Check range"
msgstr "Opseg provjere"

#: functions/math.xml:437
msgid "Sum range"
msgstr "Opseg sumiranja"

#: functions/math.xml:441
msgid ""
"The SUMIF() function calculates the sum of all values given as parameters "
"which match the criteria. The sum range is optional. If not supplied, the "
"values in the check range are summed. The length of the check range should "
"be equal or less than the length of the sum range."
msgstr ""
"Funkcija SUMIF() računa zbir svih vrijednosti datih kao parametri koje se "
"poklapaju sa kriterijumom. Opseg sumiranja je opcion. Ako nije dat, sumiraju "
"se vrijednosti u opsegu provjere. Dužina opsege provjere trebalo bi da bude "
"jednaka ili manja od dužine opsega sumiranja."

#: functions/math.xml:442
msgid "SUMIF(checkrange;criteria;sumrange)"
msgstr "SUMIF(opseg_provere;kriterijum;opseg_sumiranja)"

#: functions/math.xml:443
msgid "SUMIF(A1:A4;\">1\") sums all values in range A1:A4 which match >1"
msgstr "SUMIF(A1:A4;\">1\") sumira sve vrijednosti u opsegu A1:A4 koje su >1"

#: functions/math.xml:444
msgid ""
"SUMIF(A1:A4;\"=0\";B1:B4) sums all values in range B1:B4 if the "
"corresponding value in A1:A4 matches =0"
msgstr ""
"SUMIF(A1:A4;\"=0\";B1:B4) sumira sve vrijednosti u opsegu B1:B4 ako su "
"odgovarajuće vrijednosti u A1:A4  =0"

#: functions/math.xml:458
msgid ""
"The PRODUCT() function calculates the product of all the values given as "
"parameters. You can calculate the product of a range: PRODUCT(A1:B5) or a "
"list of values like product(12;5;12.5). If no numeric values are found 0 is "
"returned."
msgstr ""
"Funkcija PRODUCT() računa proizvod svih vrijednosti datih kao parametri. "
"Možete računati proizvod opsega, kao PRODUCT(A1:B5), ili liste vrijednosti, "
"kao PRODUCT(12;5;12.5). Ako nema nijedne numeričke vrijednosti, funkcija "
"vraća 0."

#: functions/math.xml:459
msgid "PRODUCT(value;value;...)"
msgstr "PRODUCT(vrijednost;vrijednost;...)"

#: functions/math.xml:460
msgid "PRODUCT(3;5;7) equals 105"
msgstr "PRODUCT(3;5;7) je 105"

#: functions/math.xml:461
msgid "PRODUCT(12.5;2) equals 25"
msgstr "PRODUCT(12.5;2) je 25"

#: functions/math.xml:475
msgid ""
"The KPRODUCT() function calculates the product of all the values given as "
"parameters. You can calculate the product of a range: KPRODUCT(A1:B5) or a "
"list of values like KPRODUCT(12;5;12.5). If no numeric values are found 1 is "
"returned."
msgstr ""
"Funkcija KPRODUCT() računa proizvod svih vrijednosti datih kao parametri. "
"Možete računati proizvod opsega, kao KPRODUCT(A1:B5), ili liste vrijednosti, "
"kao KPRODUCT(12;5;12.5). Ako nema nijedne numeričke vrijednosti, funkcija "
"vraća 1."

#: functions/math.xml:476
msgid "KPRODUCT(value;value;...)"
msgstr "KPRODUCT(vrijednost;vrijednost;...)"

#: functions/math.xml:477
msgid "KPRODUCT(3;5;7) equals 105"
msgstr "KPRODUCT(3;5;7) vraća 105"

#: functions/math.xml:478
msgid "KPRODUCT(12.5;2) equals 25"
msgstr "KPRODUCT(12.5;2) vraća 25"

#: functions/math.xml:493
msgid ""
"The G_PRODUCT() function is the same as KPRODUCT. It is provided for "
"Gnumeric compatibility."
msgstr ""
"Funkcija G_PRODUCT() ista je kao KPRODUCT. Data je radi kompatibilnosti sa "
"Gnumeric-om."

#: functions/math.xml:494
msgid "G_PRODUCT(value;value;...)"
msgstr "G_PRODUCT(vrijednost;vrijednost;...)"

#: functions/math.xml:507
msgid "The DIV() function divides the first value by the other values in turn."
msgstr "Funkcija INT() dijeli prvu vrijednost drugima, redom."

#: functions/math.xml:508
msgid "DIV(value;value;...)"
msgstr "DIV(vrijednost;vrijednost;...)"

#: functions/math.xml:509
msgid "DIV(20;2;2) returns 5"
msgstr "DIV(20;2;2) vraća 5"

#: functions/math.xml:510
msgid "DIV(25;2.5) returns 10"
msgstr "DIV(25;2.5) vraća 10"

#: functions/math.xml:524
msgid ""
"The SUMSQ() function calculates the sum of all the squares of values given "
"as parameters. You can calculate the sum of a range SUMSQ(A1:B5) or a list "
"of values like SUMSQ(12;5;12.5)."
msgstr ""
"Funkcija SUMSQ() računa sumu svih kvadrata vrijednosti datih kao parametri. "
"Možete računati sumu opsega, kao SUMSQ(A1:B5), ili sumu liste vrijednosti, "
"kao SUMSQ(12;5;12.5)."

#: functions/math.xml:525
msgid "SUMSQ(value;value;...)"
msgstr "SUMSQ(vrijednost;vrijednost;...)"

#: functions/math.xml:526
msgid "SUMSQ(12;5;7) equals 218"
msgstr "SUMSQ(12;5;7) je 218"

#: functions/math.xml:527
msgid "SUMSQ(12.5;2) equals 173"
msgstr "SUMSQ(12.5;2) je 173"

#: functions/math.xml:541
msgid ""
"The MAX() function returns the largest value given in the parameters. String "
"and logical values are ignored."
msgstr ""
"Funkcija MAX() vraća najveću vrijednost datu u parametrima. Znakovne i "
"logičke vrijednosti se ignorišu."

#: functions/math.xml:542
msgid "MAX(value;value;...)"
msgstr "MAX(vrijednost;vrijednost;...)"

#: functions/math.xml:543
msgid "MAX(12;5; 7) returns 12"
msgstr "MAX(12;5;7) vraća 12"

#: functions/math.xml:544
msgid "MAX(12.5; 2) returns 12.5"
msgstr "MAX(12.5;2) vraća 12.5"

#: functions/math.xml:545
msgid "MAX(0.5; 0.4; TRUE; 0.2) returns 0.5"
msgstr "MAX(0.5; 0.4; TRUE; 0.2) vraća 1"

#: functions/math.xml:562
msgid ""
"The MAXA() function returns the largest value given in the parameters. TRUE "
"evaluates to 1, FALSE evaluates to 0. String values are ignored."
msgstr ""
"Funkcija MAXA() vraća najveću vrijednost datu u parametrima. Logičko Tačno "
"se računa kao 1, a Netačno kao 0. Znakovne vrijednosti se ignorišu."

#: functions/math.xml:563
msgid "MAXA(value;value;...)"
msgstr "MAXA(vrijednost;vrijednost;...)"

#: functions/math.xml:564
msgid "MAXA(12;5; 7) returns 12"
msgstr "MAXA(12;5;7) vraća 12"

#: functions/math.xml:565
msgid "MAXA(12.5; 2) returns 12.5"
msgstr "MAXA(12.5;2) vraća 12.5"

#: functions/math.xml:566
msgid "MAXA(0.5; 0.4; TRUE; 0.2) returns 1"
msgstr "MAXA(0.5; 0.4; TRUE; 0.2) vraća 1"

#: functions/math.xml:583
msgid ""
"The MIN() function returns the smallest value given in the parameters. "
"String and logical values are ignored."
msgstr ""
"Funkcija MIN() vraća najmanju vrijednost datu u parametrima. Znakovne i "
"logičke vrijednosti se ignorišu."

#: functions/math.xml:584
msgid "MIN(value;value;...)"
msgstr "MIN(vrijednost;vrijednost;...)"

#: functions/math.xml:585
msgid "MIN(12;5; 7) returns 5"
msgstr "MIN(12;5; 7) vraća 5"

#: functions/math.xml:586
msgid "MIN(12.5; 2) returns 2"
msgstr "MIN(12.5; 2) vraća 2"

#: functions/math.xml:587
msgid "MIN(0.4; 2; FALSE; 0.7) returns 0.4"
msgstr "MIN(0.4; 2; FALSE; 0.7) vraća 0.4"

#: functions/math.xml:604
msgid ""
"The MINA() function returns the smallest value given in the parameters. TRUE "
"evaluates to 1, FALSE to 0. String values are ignored."
msgstr ""
"Funkcija MINA() vraća najmanju vrijednost datu u parametrima. Logičko Tačno "
"se smatra kao 1, a Netačno kao 0. Znakovne vrijednosti se ignorišu."

#: functions/math.xml:605
msgid "MINA(value;value;...)"
msgstr "MINA(vrijednost;vrijednost;...)"

#: functions/math.xml:606
msgid "MINA(12;5; 7) returns 5"
msgstr "MINA(12;5; 7) vraća 5"

#: functions/math.xml:607
msgid "MINA(12.5; 2) returns 2"
msgstr "MINA(12.5; 2) vraća 2"

#: functions/math.xml:608
msgid "MINA(0.4; 2; FALSE; 0.7) returns 0."
msgstr "MINA(0.4; 2; FALSE; 0.7) vraća 0."

#: functions/math.xml:625
msgid ""
"The MULTIPLY() function multiplies all the values given in the parameters. "
"You can multiply values given by a range MULTIPLY(A1:B5) or a list of values "
"like MULTIPLY(12;5;12.5). It's equivalent to PRODUCT."
msgstr ""
"Funkcija MULTIPLY() množi sve vrijednosti date u parametrima. Možete množiti "
"vrijednosti zadate opsegom, kao MULTIPLY(A1:B5), ili listom vrijednosti, kao "
"MULTIPLY(12;5;12.5). Isto kao PRODUCT."

#: functions/math.xml:626
msgid "MULTIPLY(value;value;...)"
msgstr "MULTIPLY(vrijednost;vrijednost;...)"

#: functions/math.xml:627
msgid "MULTIPLY(12;5;7) equals 420"
msgstr "MULTIPLY(12;5;7) je 420"

#: functions/math.xml:628
msgid "MULTIPLY(12.5;2) equals 25"
msgstr "MULTIPLY(12.5;2) je 25"

#: functions/math.xml:643
msgid ""
"The MULTINOMIAL() function returns the multinomial of each number in the "
"parameters. It uses this formula for MULTINOMIAL(a,b,c):"
msgstr ""
"Funkcija MULTINOMIAL() vraća multinomijal svakog broja u parametrima. Za "
"MULTINOMIAL(a,b,c) koristi se formula:"

#: functions/math.xml:644
msgid "(a+b+c)! / a!b!c!"
msgstr "(a+b+c)! / a!b!c!"

#: functions/math.xml:645
msgid "MULTINOMIAL(value;value;...)"
msgstr "MULTINOMIAL(vrijednost;vrijednost;...)"

#: functions/math.xml:646
msgid "MULTINOMIAL(3;4;5) equals 27720"
msgstr "MULTINOMIAL(3;4;5) je 27720"

#: functions/math.xml:658
msgid ""
"The SQRT() function returns the non-negative square root of the argument. It "
"is an error if the argument is negative."
msgstr ""
"SQRT() funkcija vraća ne-negativni kvadratni korijen argumenta. To je "
"greška, ako  je argument negativan."

#: functions/math.xml:659
msgid "SQRT(x)"
msgstr "SQRT(x)"

#: functions/math.xml:660
msgid "SQRT(9) equals 3"
msgstr "SQRT(9) je 3"

#: functions/math.xml:661
msgid "SQRT(-9) is an error"
msgstr "SQRT(-9) je pogrešno."

#: functions/math.xml:674
msgid ""
"The SQRTPI() function returns the non-negative square root of x * PI. It is "
"an error if the argument is negative."
msgstr ""
"SQRTPI() funkcija vraća nenegativni kvadratni korijen od x*PI.To je greška "
"ako je argument negativan."

#: functions/math.xml:675
msgid "SQRTPI(x)"
msgstr "SQRTPI(x)"

#: functions/math.xml:676
msgid "SQRTPI(2) equals 2.506628"
msgstr "SQRTPI(2) je 2.506628"

#: functions/math.xml:688
msgid "The LN() function returns the natural logarithm of x."
msgstr "Funkcija LN() vraća prirodni logaritam od x."

#: functions/math.xml:689
msgid "LN(x)"
msgstr "LN(x)"

#: functions/math.xml:690
msgid "LN(0.8) equals -0.22314355"
msgstr "LN(0.8) je -0.22314355"

#: functions/math.xml:691
msgid "LN(0) equals -inf"
msgstr "LN(0) je -inf"

#: functions/math.xml:710
msgid "The LOGn() function returns the base n logarithm of x."
msgstr "Funkcija LOGn() vraća logaritam od x za osnovu n."

#: functions/math.xml:711
msgid "LOGn(value;base)"
msgstr "LOGn(vrijednost;baza)"

#: functions/math.xml:712
msgid "LOGn(12;10) equals 1.07918125"
msgstr "LOGn(12;10) je 1.07918125"

#: functions/math.xml:713
msgid "LOGn(12;2) equals 3.5849625"
msgstr "LOGn(12;2) je 3.5849625"

#: functions/math.xml:733
msgid "The ROOTN() function returns the non-negative nth root of x."
msgstr "Funkcija ROOTN() vraća nenegativan n-ti korijen od x."

#: functions/math.xml:734
msgid "ROOTN(x;n)"
msgstr "ROOTN(x;n)"

#: functions/math.xml:735
msgid "ROOTN(9;2) equals 3"
msgstr "ROOTN(9;2) je 3"

#: functions/math.xml:748
msgid "The CUR() function returns the non-negative cube root of x."
msgstr "Funkcija CUR() vraća nenegativni kubni korijen od x."

#: functions/math.xml:749
msgid "CUR(x)"
msgstr "CUR(x)"

#: functions/math.xml:750
msgid "CUR(27) equals 3"
msgstr "CUR(27) je 3"

#: functions/math.xml:759
msgid "A floating point value, greater than zero"
msgstr "Krajnja vrijednost,veća od nule"

#: functions/math.xml:763
msgid "The LOG() function returns the base-10 logarithm of x."
msgstr "Funkcija LOG() vraća logaritam za osnovu 10 od x."

#: functions/math.xml:764
msgid "LOG(x)"
msgstr "LOG(x)"

#: functions/math.xml:765
msgid "LOG(0.8) equals -0.09691001"
msgstr "LOG(0.8) je -0.09691001"

#: functions/math.xml:766
msgid "LOG(0) is an error."
msgstr "LOG(0) je pogrešno."

#: functions/math.xml:778
msgid "A positive floating point value"
msgstr "Pozitivne vrijednosti s pomičnim zarezom"

#: functions/math.xml:782
msgid "The LOG10() function returns the base-10 logarithm of the argument."
msgstr "LOG10() funkcija vraća logaritam argumenta po bazi 10."

#: functions/math.xml:783
msgid "LOG10(x)"
msgstr "LOG10(x)"

#: functions/math.xml:784
msgid "LOG10(10) equals 1."
msgstr "LOG10(10) jednako 1."

#: functions/math.xml:785
msgid "LOG10(0) is an error."
msgstr "LOG10(0) je pogrešno."

#: functions/math.xml:801
msgid "The LOG2() function returns the base-2 logarithm of x."
msgstr "Funkcija LOG2() vraća logaritam za osnovu 2 od x."

#: functions/math.xml:802
msgid "LOG2(x)"
msgstr "LOG2(x)"

#: functions/math.xml:803
msgid "LOG2(0.8) equals -0.32192809"
msgstr "LOG2(0.8) je -0.32192809"

#: functions/math.xml:804
msgid "LOG2(0) equals -inf."
msgstr "LOG2(0) je -inf."

#: functions/math.xml:820
msgid ""
"The EXP() function returns the value of e (the base of natural logarithms) "
"raised to the power of x."
msgstr ""
"Funkcija EXP() vraća vrijednost e (baza prirodnog logaritma) podignutu na "
"stepen x."

#: functions/math.xml:821
msgid "EXP(x)"
msgstr "EXP(x)"

#: functions/math.xml:822
msgid "EXP(9) equals 8 103.08392758"
msgstr "EXP(9) je 8 103.08392758"

#: functions/math.xml:823
msgid "EXP(-9) equals 0.00012341"
msgstr "EXP(-9) je 0.00012341"

#: functions/math.xml:836
msgid ""
"The CEIL() function rounds x up to the nearest integer, returning that value "
"as a double."
msgstr ""
"Funkcija CEIL() zaokružuje x na najbliži veći cio broj, a vraća dobijenu "
"vrijednost kao realan broj."

#: functions/math.xml:837
msgid "CEIL(x)"
msgstr "CEIL(x)"

#: functions/math.xml:838
msgid "CEIL(12.5) equals 13"
msgstr "CEIL(12.5) je 13"

#: functions/math.xml:839
msgid "CEIL(-12.5) equals -12"
msgstr "CEIL(-12.5) je -12"

#: functions/math.xml:853 functions/math.xml:880
msgid "Significance (optional)"
msgstr "Značaj (opciono)"

#: functions/math.xml:857 functions/math.xml:884
msgid "Mode (optional)"
msgstr "Način (po izboru)"

#: functions/math.xml:861
msgid ""
"The CEILING() function rounds x up (away from zero) to the nearest multiple "
"of Significance. The default value for Significance is 1 (or -1 if the value "
"is negative), which means rounding up to the nearest integer. If the Mode "
"parameter is non-zero, the function rounds away from zero, instead of up "
"towards the positive infinity."
msgstr ""
"CEILING() Funkcija zaokružuje x gore (od nule) do najbliže višekratnik "
"značaja. Zadana vrijednost za Značaj je 1 (ili -1 ako je vrijednost "
"negativna), što znači zaokruživanje na najbliži cijeli broj. Ako je mod "
"parametar nuls, funkcija zaokružuje dalje od nule, umjesto gore prema "
"pozitivnom beskonačnosti."

#: functions/math.xml:862
msgid "CEILING(x)"
msgstr "CEILING(x)"

#: functions/math.xml:863
msgid "CEILING(12.5) equals 13"
msgstr "CEILING(12.5) je 13"

#: functions/math.xml:864
msgid "CEILING(6.43; 4) equals 8"
msgstr "CEILING(6.43; 4) je 8"

#: functions/math.xml:865
msgid "CEILING(-6.43; -4; 1) equals -8"
msgstr "CEILING(-6.43; -4; 1) jednako -8"

#: functions/math.xml:866
msgid "CEILING(-6.43; -4; 0) equals -4"
msgstr "CEILING(-6.43; -4; 0) jednako -4"

#: functions/math.xml:888
msgid ""
"Round a number x down to the nearest multiple of the second parameter, "
"Significance."
msgstr "Zaokružen broj x na najbližu višestrukost drugog parametra,tačnost."

#: functions/math.xml:895
msgid ""
"The FLOOR() function rounds x down (towards zero) to the nearest multiple of "
"Significance.\n"
"                The default value for Significance is 1, if x is positive. "
"It is -1, if the value is negative,\n"
"                which means rounding up to the nearest integer.\n"
"                If mode is given and not equal to zero, the amount of x is "
"rounded toward zero to a multiple\n"
"                of significance and then the sign applied. Otherwise, it "
"rounds toward negative infinity.\n"
"                    If any of the two parameters x or Significance is zero, "
"the result is zero."
msgstr ""
"Funkcija FLOOR() zaokružava prema dolje (prema nuli) do najbliže višekratnik "
"Značaj.\n"
"                Zadana vrijednost za Značaj je 1, ako je x pozitivan. To je "
"-1, ako je vrijednost negativna,\n"
"                što znači zaokruživanje na najbliži cijeli broj.\n"
"                Ako je mod naveden  i nije jednak nuli, iznos x zaokružuje "
"prema nula do višestrukog\n"
"                od značaja i onda se znak primjejnjuje. Inače, to zaokružuje "
"prema negativnom beskonačnosti.\n"
"                    Ako bilo koji od dva parametara x ili Značaj je nula, "
"rezultat je nula."

#: functions/math.xml:896
msgid "FLOOR(x)"
msgstr "FLOOR(x)"

#: functions/math.xml:897
msgid "FLOOR(12.5) equals 12"
msgstr "FLOOR(12.5) je 12"

#: functions/math.xml:898
msgid "FLOOR(-12.5) equals -13"
msgstr "FLOOR(-12.5) je -13"

#: functions/math.xml:899
msgid "FLOOR(5; 2) equals 4"
msgstr "FLOOR(5; 2) jednako 4"

#: functions/math.xml:900
msgid "FLOOR(5; 2.2) equals 4.4"
msgstr "FLOOR(5; 2.2) jednako 4.4"

#: functions/math.xml:914
msgid ""
"The ABS() function returns the absolute value of the floating-point number x."
msgstr "Funkcija ABS() vraća apsolutnu vrijednost realnog broja x."

#: functions/math.xml:915
msgid "ABS(x)"
msgstr "ABS(x)"

#: functions/math.xml:916
msgid "ABS(12.5) equals 12.5"
msgstr "ABS(12.5) je 12.5"

#: functions/math.xml:917
msgid "ABS(-12.5) equals 12.5"
msgstr "ABS(-12.5) je 12.5"

#: functions/math.xml:929
msgid "The INT() function returns the integer part of the value."
msgstr "Funkcija INT() vraća celobrojni dio vrijednosti."

#: functions/math.xml:930
msgid "INT(x)"
msgstr "INT(x)"

#: functions/math.xml:931
msgid "INT(12.55) equals 12"
msgstr "INT(12.55) je 12"

#: functions/math.xml:932
msgid "INT(15) equals 15"
msgstr "INT(15) je 15"

#: functions/math.xml:942
msgid "The RAND() function returns a pseudo-random number between 0 and 1."
msgstr "Funkcija RAND() vraća pseudoslučajan broj između 0 i 1."

#: functions/math.xml:943
msgid "RAND()"
msgstr "RAND()"

#: functions/math.xml:944
msgid "RAND() equals for example 0.78309922..."
msgstr "RAND() daje npr. 0.78309922..."

#: functions/math.xml:954 functions/math.xml:969
msgid "A floating point value (greater 0)"
msgstr "Realna vrijednost (veća od 0)"

#: functions/math.xml:958
msgid ""
"The RANDEXP() function returns an exponentially-distributed pseudo-random "
"number."
msgstr ""
"Funkcija RANDEXP() vraća eksponencijalno distribuiran pseudoslučajan broj."

#: functions/math.xml:959
msgid "RANDEXP(x)"
msgstr "RANDEXP(x)"

#: functions/math.xml:960
msgid "RANDEXP(0.88)"
msgstr "RANDEXP(0.88)"

#: functions/math.xml:977
msgid ""
"The RANDPOISSON() function returns a poisson-distributed pseudo-random "
"number."
msgstr ""
"Funkcija RANDPOISSON() vraća poasonski distribuiran pseudoslučajan broj."

#: functions/math.xml:978
msgid "RANDPOISSON(x)"
msgstr "RANDPOISSON(x)"

#: functions/math.xml:979
msgid "RANDPOISSON(4)"
msgstr "RANDPOISSON(4)"

#: functions/math.xml:988 functions/math.xml:1008 functions/math.xml:1028
msgid "A floating point value (between 0 and 1)"
msgstr "Realna vrijednost (između 0 i 1)"

#: functions/math.xml:992
msgid "Trials (greater 0)"
msgstr "Probe (veće od 0)"

#: functions/math.xml:996
msgid ""
"The RANDBINOM() function returns a binomially-distributed pseudo-random "
"number."
msgstr "Funkcija RANDBINOM() vraća binomno distribuiran pseudoslučajan broj."

#: functions/math.xml:997
msgid "RANDBINOM(x)"
msgstr "RANDBINOM(x)"

#: functions/math.xml:998
msgid "RANDBINOM(4)"
msgstr "RANDBINOM(4)"

#: functions/math.xml:1012
msgid "Failures (greater 0)"
msgstr "Neuspjesi (veći od 0)"

#: functions/math.xml:1016
msgid ""
"The RANDNEGBINOM() function returns a negative binomially-distributed pseudo-"
"random number."
msgstr ""
"Funkcija RANDNEGBINOM() vraća negativan binomno distribuiran pseudoslučajan "
"broj."

#: functions/math.xml:1017
msgid "RANDNEGBINOM(x)"
msgstr "RANDNEGBINOM(x)"

#: functions/math.xml:1018
msgid "RANDNEGBINOM(4)"
msgstr "RANDNEGBINOM(4)"

#: functions/math.xml:1036
msgid ""
"The RANDBERNOULLI() function returns a Bernoulli-distributed pseudo-random "
"number."
msgstr ""
"Funkcija RANDBERNOULLI() vraća bernulijanski distribuiran pseudoslučajan "
"broj."

#: functions/math.xml:1037
msgid "RANDBERNOULLI(x)"
msgstr "RANDBERNOULLI(x)"

#: functions/math.xml:1038
msgid "RANDBERNOULLI(0.45)"
msgstr "RANDBERNOULLI(0.45)"

#: functions/math.xml:1047
msgid "Mean value of the normal distribution"
msgstr "Srednja vrijednost normalne distribucije"

#: functions/math.xml:1051
msgid "Dispersion of the normal distribution"
msgstr "Disperzija normalne distribucije"

#: functions/math.xml:1055
msgid ""
"The RANDNORM() function returns a Normal(Gaussian)-distributed pseudo-random "
"number."
msgstr ""
"Funkcija RANDBINOM() vraća normalno (Gausovski) distribuiran pseudoslučajan "
"broj."

#: functions/math.xml:1056
msgid "RANDNORM(mu; sigma)"
msgstr "RANDNORM(mu; sigma)"

#: functions/math.xml:1057
msgid "RANDNORM(0; 1)"
msgstr "RANDNORM(0; 1)"

#: functions/math.xml:1066
msgid "Bottom value"
msgstr "Donja vrijednost"

#: functions/math.xml:1070
msgid "Top value"
msgstr "Gornja vrijednost"

#: functions/math.xml:1074
msgid ""
"The RANDBETWEEN() function returns a pseudo-random number between bottom and "
"top value. If bottom > top this function returns Err."
msgstr ""
"Funkcija RANDBETWEEN() vraća pseudoslučajan broj između zadate gornje i "
"donje vrijednosti. Ako je donja veća gornje vrijednosti, funkcija vraća "
"grešku."

#: functions/math.xml:1075
msgid "RANDBETWEEN(bottom;top)"
msgstr "RANDBETWEEN(donje;gornje)"

#: functions/math.xml:1076
msgid "RANDBETWEEN(12;78) equals for example 61.0811..."
msgstr "RANDBETWEEN(12;78) daje npr. 61.0811..."

#: functions/math.xml:1088
msgid "Multiple"
msgstr "Proizvod"

#: functions/math.xml:1092
msgid ""
"The MROUND() function returns the value rounded to the specified multiple. "
"The value and the multiple must have the same sign"
msgstr ""
"Funkcija MROUND() vraća vrijednost zaokruženu na dati umnožak. Vrijednost i "
"proizvod moraju biti istog znaka."

#: functions/math.xml:1093
msgid "MROUND(value; multiple)"
msgstr "MROUND(vrijednost; proizvod)"

#: functions/math.xml:1094
msgid "MROUND(1.252; 0.5) equals 1.5"
msgstr "MROUND(1.252; 0.5) je 1.5"

#: functions/math.xml:1095
msgid "MROUND(-1.252; -0.5) equals -1.5"
msgstr "MROUND(-1.252; -0.5) je -1.5"

#: functions/math.xml:1108 functions/math.xml:1133 functions/math.xml:1156
msgid "Digits"
msgstr "Cifre"

#: functions/math.xml:1112
msgid ""
"The ROUND(value;[digits]) function returns value rounded. Digits is the "
"number of digits to which you want to round that number. If digits is zero "
"or omitted, value is rounded up to the nearest integer. If digits is smaller "
"than zero, the corresponding integer part of the number is rounded."
msgstr ""
"Funkcija ROUND(vrijednost;[cifre]) vraća zaokruženu vrijednost. „Cifre„ su "
"broj cifara na koji želite da zaokružite broj. Ako su „cifre“ nula ili se "
"izostave, vrijednost se zaokružuje na najbliži cio broj. Ako su „cifre“ "
"manje od nule, zaokružuje se odgovarajući celobrojni dio broja."

#: functions/math.xml:1113
msgid "ROUND(value;[digits])"
msgstr "ROUND(vrijednost;[cifre])"

#: functions/math.xml:1114
msgid "ROUND(1.252;2) equals 1.25"
msgstr "ROUND(1.252;2) je 1.25"

#: functions/math.xml:1115
msgid "ROUND(-1.252;2) equals -1.25"
msgstr "ROUND(-1.252;2) je -1.25"

#: functions/math.xml:1116
msgid "ROUND(1.258;2) equals 1.26"
msgstr "ROUND(1.258;2) je 1.26"

#: functions/math.xml:1117
msgid "ROUND(-12.25;-1) equals -10"
msgstr "ROUND(-12.25;-1) je -10"

#: functions/math.xml:1118
msgid "ROUND(-1.252;0) equals -1"
msgstr "ROUND(-1.252;0) je -1"

#: functions/math.xml:1137
msgid ""
"The ROUNDUP(value;[digits]) function returns value rounded so that its "
"absolute value is greater. Digits is the number of digits to which you want "
"to round that number. If digits is zero or omitted, value is rounded up to "
"the nearest integer."
msgstr ""
"ROUNDUP(vrijednost;[brojke]) funkcija vraća zaokruženu vrijednost,a njegova "
"apsolutna vrijednost je veća.Brojke su broj brojki na koliko da se zaokruži "
"broj.Ako je brojka nula ili izostavljena,vrijednost je zaokružena na "
"najbliži cijeli broj."

#: functions/math.xml:1138
msgid "ROUNDUP(value;[digits])"
msgstr "ROUNDUP(vrijednost;[cifre])"

#: functions/math.xml:1139
msgid "ROUNDUP(1.252) equals 2"
msgstr "ROUNDUP(1.252) jednako 2"

#: functions/math.xml:1140
msgid "ROUNDUP(1.252;2) equals 1.26"
msgstr "ROUNDUP(1.252;2) je 1.26"

#: functions/math.xml:1141
msgid "ROUNDUP(-1.252;2) equals -1.26"
msgstr "ROUNDUP(-1.252;2) jednako -1.26"

#: functions/math.xml:1142
msgid "ROUNDUP(-1.252) equals -2"
msgstr "ROUNDUP(-1.252) jednako -2"

#: functions/math.xml:1160
msgid ""
"The ROUNDDOWN(value;[digits]) function returns value rounded so that its "
"absolute value is lesser. Digits is the number of digits to which you want "
"to round that number. If digits is zero or omitted, value is rounded down to "
"the nearest integer."
msgstr ""
"ROUNDDOWN(vrijednost;[brojke]) funkcija vraća vrijednost zaokruženu,a "
"njegova apsolutna vrijednost je manja.Brojke su broj brojki na koliko da se "
"zaokuži broj.Ako je brojka nula ili izostavljena,vrijednost je zaokružena na "
"najbilži cijeli broj."

#: functions/math.xml:1161
msgid "ROUNDDOWN(value;[digits])"
msgstr "ROUNDDOWN(vrijednost;[cifre])"

#: functions/math.xml:1162
msgid "ROUNDDOWN(1.252) equals 1"
msgstr "ROUNDDOWN(1.252) jednako 1"

#: functions/math.xml:1163
msgid "ROUNDDOWN(1.252;2) equals 1.25"
msgstr "ROUNDDOWN(1.252;2) je 1.25"

#: functions/math.xml:1164
msgid "ROUNDDOWN(-1.252;2) equals -1.25"
msgstr "ROUNDDOWN(-1.252;2) jednako -1.25"

#: functions/math.xml:1165
msgid "ROUNDDOWN(-1.252) equals -1"
msgstr "ROUNDDOWN(-1.252) jednako -1"

#: functions/math.xml:1175
msgid "Nth term"
msgstr "N-ti član"

#: functions/math.xml:1179
msgid ""
"Function FIB calculates the Nth term of a Fibonacci sequence (1, 1, 2, 3, 5, "
"8, 13, 21...), in which each number, after the first two, is the sum of the "
"two numbers immediately preceding it. FIB(0) is defined to be 0."
msgstr ""
"Funkcija FIB računa N-ti član Fibonačijevog niza (1, 1, 2, 3, 5, 8, 13, "
"21...), u kojem je svaki broj, posle prva dva, jednak zbiru dva broja koja "
"mu direktno prethode. FIB(0) je definisano kao 0."

#: functions/math.xml:1180
msgid "FIB(n)"
msgstr "FIB(n)"

#: functions/math.xml:1181
msgid "FIB(9) returns 34"
msgstr "FIB(9) vraća 34"

#: functions/math.xml:1182
msgid "FIB(26) returns 121393"
msgstr "FIB(26) vraća 121393"

#: functions/math.xml:1190
msgid "Numerator"
msgstr "Numerator"

#: functions/math.xml:1194
msgid "Denumerator"
msgstr "Denumerator"

#: functions/math.xml:1198
msgid "Function QUOTIENT returns the integer portion of numerator/denumerator."
msgstr "Funkcija QUOTIENT vraća cio dio numeratora/denumeratora."

#: functions/math.xml:1199
msgid "QUOTIENT(numerator;denumerator)"
msgstr "QUOTIENT(numerator;denumerator)"

#: functions/math.xml:1200
msgid "QUOTIENT(21;4) returns 5"
msgstr "QUOTIENT(21;4) je 5"

#: functions/math.xml:1213
msgid ""
"Function MDETERM returns the determinant of a given matrix. The matrix must "
"be of type n x n."
msgstr ""
"Funkcija MDETERM vraća determinantu date matrice. Matrica mora biti "
"kvadratna."

#: functions/math.xml:1214
msgid "MDETERM(matrix)"
msgstr "MDETERM(matrica)"

#: functions/math.xml:1215
msgid "MDETERM(A1:C3)"
msgstr "MDETERM(A1:C3)"

#: functions/math.xml:1224
msgid "First matrix"
msgstr "Prva matrica"

#: functions/math.xml:1228
msgid "Second matrix"
msgstr "Druga matrica"

#: functions/math.xml:1232
msgid ""
"Function MMULT multiplies two matrices. Number of columns of the first "
"matrix must be the same as row count of the second one. The result is a "
"matrix."
msgstr ""
"Funkcija MMULT množi dvije matrice.Broj kolona prve matrice mora biti jednak "
"broju redova druge.Rezultat je matrica."

#: functions/math.xml:1233
msgid "MMULT(matrix1;matrix2)"
msgstr "MMULT(matrica1;matrica2)"

#: functions/math.xml:1234
msgid "MMULT(A1:C3)"
msgstr "MMULT(A1:C3)"

#: functions/math.xml:1243 functions/math.xml:1276
msgid "Matrix"
msgstr "Matrica"

#: functions/math.xml:1247
msgid "Calculates the inverse of the matrix."
msgstr "Računanje inverzne matrice"

#: functions/math.xml:1248
msgid ""
"The matrix multiplied with its inverse results in the unity matrix of the "
"same dimension."
msgstr ""
"Množenje matrice sa njenom inverznom,rezultat je jedinstvena matrica istih "
"dimenzija."

#: functions/math.xml:1249
msgid "Invertible matrices have a non-zero determinant."
msgstr "Matrica koja se može invertovati ima determinantu različitu od nule."

#: functions/math.xml:1250
msgid "MINVERSE(matrix)"
msgstr "MINVERSE(matrca)"

#: functions/math.xml:1251
msgid "MINVERSE(A1:C3)"
msgstr "MINVERSE(A1:C3)"

#: functions/math.xml:1261
msgid "Dimension"
msgstr "Dimenzija"

#: functions/math.xml:1265
msgid "Creates the unity matrix of the given dimension."
msgstr "Kreiraj jedinstvenu matricu sa datim dimenzijama."

#: functions/math.xml:1266
msgid "MUNIT(dimension)"
msgstr "MUNIT(dimenzija)"

#: functions/math.xml:1267
msgid "MUNIT(3) creates a 3x3 unity matrix"
msgstr "MUNIT(3) kreira 3x3 jedinstvenu matricu"

#: functions/math.xml:1280
msgid ""
"Returns the transpose of a matrix, i.e. rows and columns of the matrix are "
"exchanged."
msgstr "Vraća transponovanu matricu,tj.redovi i kolone matrice su zamjenjeni."

#: functions/math.xml:1281
msgid "TRANSPOSE(matrix)"
msgstr "TRANSPOSE(matrica)"

#: functions/math.xml:1282
msgid "TRANSPOSE(A1:C3)"
msgstr "TRANSPOSE(A1:C3)"

#: functions/reference.xml:5
msgid "Lookup & Reference"
msgstr "Potraga i referenciranje"

#: functions/reference.xml:11
msgid "Row number"
msgstr "Broj vrste"

#: functions/reference.xml:15
msgid "Column number"
msgstr "Broj kolone"

#: functions/reference.xml:19
msgid "Absolute number (optional)"
msgstr "Apsolutan broj (opciono)"

#: functions/reference.xml:23 functions/reference.xml:160
msgid "A1 style (optional)"
msgstr "A1 stil (opciono)"

#: functions/reference.xml:27 MapModel.cpp:141
msgid "Sheet name"
msgstr "Ime lista"

#: functions/reference.xml:31
msgid ""
"The ADDRESS creates a cell address. Parameter Row is the row number and "
"Column is the column number."
msgstr ""
"Funkcija ADDRESS pravi adresu ćelije. Parametar „vrsta“ je broj vrste, a "
"„kolona“ je broj kolone."

#: functions/reference.xml:32
msgid ""
"Absolute number specifies the type of reference: 1 or omitted = Absolute, 2 "
"= Absolute row, relative column,  3 = Relative row; absolute column and 4 = "
"Relative."
msgstr ""
"Apsolutan broj navodi tip reference: 1 (ili ako ga nema) = apsolutna, 2 = "
"apsolutna po vrsti, relativna po koloni, 3 = relativna po vrsti, apsolutna "
"po koloni, 4 = relativna."

#: functions/reference.xml:33
msgid ""
"A1 Style specifies the style of the address to return. If A1 is set to TRUE "
"(default) the address is returned in A1 style if it is set to FALSE in R1C1 "
"style."
msgstr ""
"A1 stil navodi stil adrese se koja se vraća. Ako je A1 postavljeno na Tačno "
"(podrazumevano) adresa se vraća u A1 stilu, a ako je postavljeno na Netačno, "
"u R1C1 stilu."

#: functions/reference.xml:34
msgid "Sheet name is the text specifying the name of the sheet."
msgstr "Ime lista je tekst koji navodi ime lista."

#: functions/reference.xml:35
msgid "ADDRESS(row; col; absolute; style; sheet name)"
msgstr "ADDRESS(vrsta; kolona; apsolutno; stil; ime lista)"

#: functions/reference.xml:36
msgid "ADDRESS(6; 4) returns $D$6"
msgstr "ADDRESS(6; 4) vraća $D$6"

#: functions/reference.xml:37
msgid "ADDRESS(6; 4; 2) returns D$6"
msgstr "ADDRESS(6; 4; 2) vraća D$6"

#: functions/reference.xml:38
msgid "ADDRESS(6; 4; 2; FALSE; \"Sheet1\") returns Sheet1!R6C[4]"
msgstr "ADDRESS(6; 4; 2; FALSE; \"List1\") vraća List1!R6C[4]"

#: functions/reference.xml:39
msgid "ADDRESS(6; 4; 1; FALSE; \"Sheet1\") returns Sheet1!R6C4"
msgstr "ADDRESS(6; 4; 1; FALSE; \"List1\") vraća List1!R6C4"

#: functions/reference.xml:40
msgid "ADDRESS(6; 4; 4; TRUE; \"Sheet1\") returns Sheet1!D6"
msgstr "ADDRESS(6; 4; 4; TRUE; \"List1\") vraća List1!D6"

#: functions/reference.xml:52
msgid ""
"Returns the number of areas in the reference string. An area can be asingle "
"cell or a set of cells."
msgstr ""
"Vraća broj oblasti u znakovnom nizu reference. Oblast može biti jedna ćelija "
"ili skup ćelija."

#: functions/reference.xml:53
msgid "AREAS(reference)"
msgstr "AREAS(referenca)"

#: functions/reference.xml:54
msgid "AREAS(A1) returns 1"
msgstr "AREAS(A1) vraća 1"

#: functions/reference.xml:55
msgid "AREAS((A1; A2:A4)) returns 2"
msgstr "AREAS((A1; A2:A4)) vraća 2"

#: functions/reference.xml:71
msgid ""
"Returns information about position, formatting or contents in a reference."
msgstr "Vraća podatke o poziciji, formatiranju ili sadržaju u referenci."

#: functions/reference.xml:72
msgid "CELL(type; reference)"
msgstr "CELL(tip; referenca)"

#: functions/reference.xml:73
msgid "CELL(\"COL\", C7) returns 3"
msgstr "CELL(\"COL\", C7) vraća 3"

#: functions/reference.xml:74
msgid "CELL(\"ROW\", C7) returns 7"
msgstr "CELL(\"ROW\", C7) vraća 7"

#: functions/reference.xml:75
msgid "CELL(\"ADDRESS\", C7) returns $C$7"
msgstr "CELL(\"ADDRESS\", C7) vraća $C$7"

#: functions/reference.xml:82
msgid "Index"
msgstr "Indeks"

#: functions/reference.xml:86
msgid "Arguments"
msgstr "Argumenti"

#: functions/reference.xml:89
msgid "Returns the parameter specified by the index."
msgstr "Vraća parametar naveden indeksom."

#: functions/reference.xml:90
msgid "CHOOSE(index; parameter1; parameter2;...)"
msgstr "CHOOSE(indeks; parametar1; parametar2;...)"

#: functions/reference.xml:91
msgid "CHOOSE(1; \"1st\"; \"2nd\") returns \"1st\""
msgstr "CHOOSE(1; \"prvi\"; \"drugi\") vraća \"prvi\""

#: functions/reference.xml:92
msgid "CHOOSE(2; 3; 2; 4) returns 2"
msgstr "CHOOSE(2; 3; 2; 4) vraća 2"

#: functions/reference.xml:104
msgid ""
"The COLUMN function returns the column of given cell reference. If no "
"parameter is specified the column of the current cell gets returned."
msgstr ""
"Funkcija COLUMN vraća kolonu date reference ćelije. Ako se ne navede nijedan "
"parametar, funkcija vraća kolonu tekuće ćelije."

#: functions/reference.xml:105
msgid "COLUMN(reference)"
msgstr "COLUMN(referenca)"

#: functions/reference.xml:106
msgid "COLUMN(A1) returns 1"
msgstr "COLUMN(A1) vraća 1"

#: functions/reference.xml:107
msgid "COLUMN(D2) returns 4"
msgstr "COLUMN(D2) vraća 4"

#: functions/reference.xml:121
msgid "The COLUMNS function returns the number of columns in a reference."
msgstr "Funkcija COLUMNS vraća broj kolona u referenci."

#: functions/reference.xml:122
msgid "COLUMNS(reference)"
msgstr "COLUMNS(referenca)"

#: functions/reference.xml:123
msgid "COLUMNS(A1:C3) returns 3"
msgstr "COLUMNS(A1:C3) vraća 3"

#: functions/reference.xml:124
msgid "COLUMNS(D2) returns 1"
msgstr "COLUMNS(D2) vraća 1"

#: functions/reference.xml:137 functions/reference.xml:266
msgid "Row"
msgstr "Red"

#: functions/reference.xml:145
msgid ""
"If a range is given, returns value stored in a given row/column. If one cell "
"is given, which contains an array, then one element of the array is returned."
msgstr ""
"Ako je dat opseg, vraća vrijednost koja se nalazi u datoj vrsti/koloni. Ako "
"je data jedna ćelija koja sadrži niz, vraća se jedan element tog niza."

#: functions/reference.xml:146
msgid "INDEX(cell, row, column)"
msgstr "INDEX(ćelija, vrsta, kolona)"

#: functions/reference.xml:147
msgid "INDEX(range, row, column)"
msgstr "INDEX(opseg, vrsta, kolona)"

#: functions/reference.xml:148
msgid "INDEX(A1:C3;2;2), returns contents of B2"
msgstr "INDEX(A1:C3;2;2) vraća sadržaj B2"

#: functions/reference.xml:149
msgid ""
"INDEX(A1;2;2), if A1 is a result of array calculation, returns its (2,2) "
"element."
msgstr ""
"INDEX(A1;2;2), ako A1 sadrži niz kao rezultat proračuna, vraća njegov "
"element (2,2)."

#: functions/reference.xml:164
msgid ""
"Returns the content of the cell specified by the reference text. The second "
"parameter is optional."
msgstr ""
"Vraća sadržaj ćelije navedene tekstom reference. Drugi parametar je opcioni."

#: functions/reference.xml:165
msgid "INDIRECT(referenceText, a1 style)"
msgstr "INDIRECT(tekst_reference, A1 stil)"

#: functions/reference.xml:166
msgid "INDIRECT(A1), A1 contains \"B1\", and B1 1 => returns 1"
msgstr "INDIRECT(A1), A1 sadrži \"B1\", a B1 sadrži 1 => vraća se 1"

#: functions/reference.xml:167
msgid "INDIRECT(\"A1\"), returns content of A1"
msgstr "INDIRECT(\"A1\"), vraća sadržaj A1"

#: functions/reference.xml:179
msgid ""
"The ROW function returns the row of given cell reference. If no parameter is "
"specified the row of the current cell gets returned."
msgstr ""
"Funkcija ROW vraća vrstu date reference na ćeliju. Ako se ne navede nijedan "
"parametar, funkcija vraća vrstu tekuće ćelije."

#: functions/reference.xml:180
msgid "ROW(reference)"
msgstr "ROW(referenca)"

#: functions/reference.xml:181
msgid "ROW(A1) returns 1"
msgstr "ROW(A1) vraća 1"

#: functions/reference.xml:182
msgid "ROW(D2) returns 2"
msgstr "ROW(D2) vraća 2"

#: functions/reference.xml:196
msgid "The ROWS function returns the number of rows in a reference."
msgstr "Funkcija ROWS vraća broj vrsta u referenci."

#: functions/reference.xml:197
msgid "ROWS(reference)"
msgstr "ROWS(referenca)"

#: functions/reference.xml:198
msgid "ROWS(A1:C3) returns 3"
msgstr "ROWS(A1:C3) vraća 3"

#: functions/reference.xml:199
msgid "ROWS(D2) returns 1"
msgstr "ROWS(D2) vraća 1"

#: functions/reference.xml:213
msgid ""
"Returns the sheet number of the reference or the string representing a sheet "
"name."
msgstr "Vraća broj lista reference ili string koji predstavlja ime lista."

#: functions/reference.xml:214
msgid "SHEET(reference)"
msgstr "SHEET(referenca)"

#: functions/reference.xml:215
msgid "SHEET(Sheet1!C7) returns 1"
msgstr "SHEET(Sheet1!C7) craća1"

#: functions/reference.xml:216
msgid "SHEET(Sheet2!C7) returns 2"
msgstr "SHEET(Sheet2!C7) vraća 2"

#: functions/reference.xml:228
msgid "Returns the number of sheets in a reference or current document."
msgstr "Vraća broj lista u referenci ili trenutni dokument."

#: functions/reference.xml:229
msgid "SHEETS(reference)"
msgstr "SHEETS(referenca)"

#: functions/reference.xml:236 functions/reference.xml:258
#: functions/reference.xml:284
msgid "Lookup value"
msgstr "Vrijednost za potragu"

#: functions/reference.xml:240
msgid "Lookup vector"
msgstr "Vektor za potragu"

#: functions/reference.xml:244
msgid "Result vector"
msgstr "Vektor rezultata"

#: functions/reference.xml:248
msgid ""
"The LOOKUP function looks up the first parameter in the lookup vector. It "
"returns a value in the result Vector with the same index as the matching "
"value in the lookup vector. If value is not in the lookup vector it takes "
"the next lower one. If no value in the lookup vector matches an error is "
"returned. The lookup vector must be in ascending order and lookup and result "
"vector must have the same size. Numeric values, string and boolean values "
"are recognized. Comparison between strings is case-insensitive."
msgstr ""
"Funkcija LOOKUP traži prvi parametar u vektoru za potragu. Vraća vrijednost "
"u vektoru rezultata sa istim indeksom kao odgovarajuća vrijednost u vektoru "
"za potragu. Ako vrijednosti nema u vektoru za potragu, uzima se prva "
"sljedeća manja. Ako se i dalje ne može poklopiti vektor za potragu, vraća se "
"greška. Vektor za potragu mora biti uređen rastuće i oba vektora moraju biti "
"iste veličine. Prepoznaju se znakovne, logičke i numeričke vrijednosti. "
"Poređenje znakovnih nizova razlikuje velika i mala slova."

#: functions/reference.xml:249
msgid "LOOKUP(value; lookup vector; result vector)"
msgstr "LOOKUP(vrijednost; vektor za potragu; vektor rezultata)"

#: functions/reference.xml:250
msgid "LOOKUP(1.232; A1:A6; B1:B6) for A1 = 1, A2 = 2 returns the value of B1."
msgstr "LOOKUP(1.232; A1:A6; B1:B6) za A1 = 1, A2 = 2 vraća vrijednost B1."

#: functions/reference.xml:262 functions/reference.xml:288
msgid "Data source"
msgstr "Izvor podataka"

#: functions/reference.xml:270 functions/reference.xml:296
msgid "Sorted (optional)"
msgstr "Sortiran(po izboru)"

#: functions/reference.xml:274
msgid ""
"Look for a matching value in the first row of the given table, and return "
"the value of the indicated row."
msgstr ""
"Potraži odgovarajuću vrijednost u prvom retku date tablice i vrati "
"vrijednost navedenog reda."

#: functions/reference.xml:275
msgid ""
"Looks up the 'lookup value' in the first row of the 'data source'. If a "
"value matches, the value in the 'row' and the column, the value was found "
"in, is returned. If 'sorted' is true (default), the first row is assumed to "
"be sorted. The search will end, if the 'lookup value' is lower than the "
"value, currently compared to."
msgstr ""
"Pogledati \"lookup value\" u prvom redu \"data source\".Ako je usklađena "
"vrijednost,vrijednost u redu i koloni,pronađena vrijednost,je vraćena.Ako je "
"\"sorted\" Tačno(podrazumijevano),prvi red je zamišljen da je sortiran."
"Pretraga će se završiti,ako je \"lookup value\"  manja nego vrijednost,"
"trenutačno poređenje."

#: functions/reference.xml:276
msgid "HLOOKUP(Lookup value; data source; Row; Sorted)"
msgstr "HLOOKUP(Netačna vrijednost; izvor podataka; Red; Sortirano)"

#: functions/reference.xml:300
msgid ""
"Look for a matching value in the first column of the given table, and return "
"the value of the indicated column."
msgstr ""
"Potražite podudaranje vrijednost u prvoj koloni date tablice, i vratiti "
"vrijednost u naznačenu kolonu."

#: functions/reference.xml:301
msgid ""
"Looks up the 'lookup value' in the first column of the 'data source'. If a "
"value matches, the value in the 'column' and the row, the value was found "
"in, is returned. If 'sorted' is true (default), the first column is assumed "
"to be sorted. The search will end, if the 'lookup value' is lower than the "
"value, currently compared to."
msgstr ""
"Pogledati \"lookup value\" u prvoj koloni \"data source\".Ako je usklađena "
"vrijednost,vrijednost u koloni i redu,pronađena vrijednost,je vraćena.Ako je "
"\"sorted\" Tačno(podrazumijevano),prvi red je zamišljen da je sortiran."
"Pretraga će se završiti,ako je \"lookup value\"  manja nego vrijednost,"
"trenutačno poređenje."

#: functions/reference.xml:302
msgid "VLOOKUP(Lookup value; data source; Column; Sorted)"
msgstr "VLOOKUP(Netačna vrijednost; izvor podataka; Kolona; Sortirano)"

#: functions/reference.xml:310
msgid "Formula cell"
msgstr "Ćelija formule"

#: functions/reference.xml:314
msgid "Row cell"
msgstr "Ćelija reda"

#: functions/reference.xml:318
msgid "Row replacement"
msgstr "Zamjena reda"

#: functions/reference.xml:322
msgid "Column cell (optional)"
msgstr "Ćelijska kolona(po izboru)"

#: functions/reference.xml:326
msgid "Column replacement (optional)"
msgstr "Zamjena kolone(po izboru)"

#: functions/reference.xml:330
msgid ""
"MULTIPLE.OPERATIONS executes the formula expression pointed to by "
"FormulaCell and all formula expressions it depends on while replacing all "
"references to RowCell with references to RowReplacement respectively all "
"references to ColumnCell with references to ColumnReplacement. The function "
"may be used to easily create tables of expressions that depend on two input "
"parameters."
msgstr ""
"MULTIPLE.OPERATIONS izvršava formula izraz pokazane s FormulaCell i sve "
"formula izraze koji ovisi o njemu, zamjenaomsvih referenci na RowCell s "
"referencama na RowReplacement odnosno svih referenci na ColumnCell s "
"referencama na ColumnReplacement. Funkcija se može koristiti za jednostavno "
"stvaranje tablice izraza koji ovisi o dva ulazna parametra."

#: functions/reference.xml:331
msgid ""
"MULTIPLE.OPERATIONS(Formula cell; Row cell; Row replacement; Column cell; "
"Column replacement)"
msgstr ""
"MULTIPLE.OPERATIONS(element formule;Element reda; popunjavanje reda; Element "
"kolone; Popunjavanje kolone)"

#: functions/reference.xml:339
msgid "Search value"
msgstr "Vrijednost pretrage"

#: functions/reference.xml:343
msgid "Search region"
msgstr "Područje pretrage"

#: functions/reference.xml:347
msgid "Match type (optional)"
msgstr "Tip podudaranja (opciono)"

#: functions/reference.xml:351
msgid ""
"Finds a search value in a search region, and returns its position (starting "
"from 1). Match type can be either -1, 0 or 1 and determines how is searched "
"for the value. If match type is 0, the index of the first value that equals "
"search value is returned. If match type is 1 (or omitted), the index of the "
"first value that is less than or equal to the search value is returned and "
"the values in the search region must be sorted in ascending order. If match "
"type is -1, the smallest value that is greater than or equal to the search "
"value is found, and the search region needs to be sorted in descending order."
msgstr ""
"Pronalazi vrijednost za pretragu u regionu, i vraća njen položaj (počev od "
"1). Tip podudaranja može biti -1, 0 ili 1 i određuje kako se traži "
"vrijednost. Ako je tip podudaranja jednak 0, vraća se indeks prve vrednosti "
"koja je jednaka traženoj. Ako je tip podudaranja jednak 1 (ili izostavljen), "
"vraća se indeks prve vrijednosti koja je manja ili jednaka od tražene, a "
"vrijednosti u regionu traženja moraju biti sortirane u rastućem redoslijedu. "
"Ako je tip podudaranja jednak -1, najmanja vrednost koja je veća od ili "
"jednaka od tražene vrijednosti se nalazi, a region traženja treba da bude "
"sortiran u opadajućem redosledu."

#: functions/reference.xml:352
msgid "MATCH(Search value; Search region; Match type)"
msgstr "MATCH(Tražena vrijednost; Region pretrage; Tip podudaranja)"

#: functions/reference.xml:360
msgid "Reference or range"
msgstr "Referenca ili opseg"

#: functions/reference.xml:364
msgid "Number of rows to offset"
msgstr "Broj redova do pomaka"

#: functions/reference.xml:368
msgid "Number of columns to offset"
msgstr "Broj kolona do pomaka"

#: functions/reference.xml:372
msgid "Height of the offset range (optional)"
msgstr "Visina opsega pomaka (opcionalno)"

#: functions/reference.xml:376
msgid "Width of the offset range (optional)"
msgstr "Širina opsega pomaka (opcionalno)"

#: functions/reference.xml:380
msgid "Modifies a reference's position and dimension."
msgstr "Mijenja poziciju i dimenziju reference."

#: functions/reference.xml:381
msgid ""
"OFFSET(Reference reference; Integer rowOffset; Integer columnOffset; Integer "
"newHeight; Integer newWidth)"
msgstr ""
"OFFSET(Reference referenca; Integer pozicijaReda; Integer pozicijaKolone; "
"Integer novaVisina; Integer novaSirina)"

