#: functions/statistical.xml:31
msgid ""
"The AVEDEV() function calculates the average of the absolute deviations of a "
"data set from their mean."
msgstr ""
"Funkcija AVEDEV() računa srednju vrijednost apsolutnih devijacija skupa "
"podataka od svoje srednje vrijednosti."

#: functions/statistical.xml:32
msgid "AVEDEV(value;value;...)"
msgstr "AVEDEV(vrijednost;vrijednost;...)"

#: functions/statistical.xml:33
msgid "AVEDEV(11.4;17.3;21.3;25.9;40.1) returns 7.84"
msgstr "AVEDEV(11.4;17.3;21.3;25.9;40.1) vraća 7.84"

#: functions/statistical.xml:34
msgid "AVEDEV(A1:A5) ..."
msgstr "AVEDEV(A1:A5) ..."

#: functions/statistical.xml:62
msgid ""
"The AVERAGE() function calculates the average of all the values given as "
"parameters. You can calculate the average of a range AVERAGE(A1:B5) or a "
"list of values like AVERAGE(12;5;12.5)."
msgstr ""
"Funkcija AVERAGE() računa srednju vrijednost svih vrijednosti datih kao "
"parametri. Možete računati srednju vrijednost opsega, kao AVERAGE(A1:B5), "
"ili liste vrijednosti, kao AVERAGE(12;5;12.5)."

#: functions/statistical.xml:63
msgid "AVERAGE(value;value;...)"
msgstr "AVERAGE(vrijednost;vrijednost;...)"

#: functions/statistical.xml:64
msgid "AVERAGE(12;5;7) equals 8"
msgstr "AVERAGE(12;5;7) je 8"

#: functions/statistical.xml:65
msgid "AVERAGE(12.5;2) equals 7.25"
msgstr "AVERAGE(12.5;2) je 7.25"

#: functions/statistical.xml:77 functions/text.xml:447 functions/text.xml:451
#: functions/text.xml:455 functions/text.xml:459 functions/text.xml:463
msgid "String values"
msgstr "Znakovni nizovi"

#: functions/statistical.xml:81
msgid ""
"The AVERAGEA() calculates the average of the given arguments. Numbers, text "
"and logical values are included in the calculation too. If the cell contains "
"text or the argument evaluates to FALSE, it is counted as value zero (0). If "
"the argument evaluates to TRUE, it is counted as one (1). Note that empty "
"cells are not counted."
msgstr ""
"Funkcija AVERAGEA() računa srednju vrijednost datih argumenata. Brojevi, "
"tekst i logičke vrijednosti takođe su uključene u račun. Ako ćelija sadrži "
"tekst ili logičko Netačno, računa se kao nula (0). Ako sadrži Tačno, računa "
"se kao jedinica (1). Prazne ćelije se ne uzimaju u obzir."

#: functions/statistical.xml:82
msgid "AVERAGEA(value;value;...)"
msgstr "AVERAGEA(vrijednost;vrijednost;...)"

#: functions/statistical.xml:83
msgid "AVERAGEA(11.4;17.3;\"sometext\";25.9;40.1) equals 18.94"
msgstr "AVERAGEA(11.4;17.3;\"tekst\";25.9;40.1) je 18.94"

#: functions/statistical.xml:95 functions/statistical.xml:131
#: functions/statistical.xml:433 functions/statistical.xml:462
#: functions/statistical.xml:1669
msgid "Alpha parameter"
msgstr "Alfa parametar"

#: functions/statistical.xml:99 functions/statistical.xml:135
#: functions/statistical.xml:437 functions/statistical.xml:466
#: functions/statistical.xml:1673
msgid "Beta parameter"
msgstr "Bita parametar"

#: functions/statistical.xml:103 functions/statistical.xml:139
msgid "Start"
msgstr "Pokreni"

#: functions/statistical.xml:107 functions/statistical.xml:143
msgid "End"
msgstr "Kraj"

#: functions/statistical.xml:111
msgid "Cumulative"
msgstr "Kumulativno"

#: functions/statistical.xml:115
msgid ""
"The BETADIST() function returns the cumulative beta probability density "
"function."
msgstr "Funkcija BETADIST() vraća kumulativnu gustinu beta-verovatnoće."

#: functions/statistical.xml:116
msgid ""
"The third and fourth parameters are optional. They set the lower and upper "
"bounds, otherwise defaulting to 0.0 and 1.0 respectively."
msgstr ""
"Treći i četvrti parametar su po izboru.Oni su postavili donje i gornje "
"granice,inače podrazumjevano 0.0 i 1.0 respektivno."

#: functions/statistical.xml:117
msgid "BETADIST(number;alpha;beta;start;end;[cumulative=TRUE])"
msgstr "BETADIST(broj;alfa;beta;početak;kraj;[kumulativno=TRUE])"

#: functions/statistical.xml:118
msgid "BETADIST(0.2859;0.2606;0.8105) equals 0.675444"
msgstr "BETADIST(0.2859;0.2606;0.8105) je 0.675444"

#: functions/statistical.xml:119
msgid "BETADIST(0.2859;0.2606;0.8105;0.2;0.9) equals 0.537856"
msgstr "BETADIST(0.2859;0.2606;0.8105;0.2;0.9) je 0.537856"

#: functions/statistical.xml:147
msgid ""
"The BETAINV() function returns the inverse of BETADIST(x;alpha;beta;a;b;TRUE"
"())."
msgstr ""
"BETAINV() funkcija vraća inverznu od BETADIST(x;alpha;beta;a;b;TRUE())."

#: functions/statistical.xml:148
msgid ""
"The start and end parameters are optional. They set the lower and upper "
"bounds, otherwise defaulting to 0.0 and 1.0 respectively."
msgstr ""
"Početni i krajnji parametar su po izboru.Oni postavljaju donju i gornju "
"granicu,Inače podrazumijevano 0.0 i 1.0 respektivno."

#: functions/statistical.xml:149
msgid "BETAINV(number;alpha;beta [; start=0 [; end=1]])"
msgstr "BETAINV(broj;alfa;beta [; početak=0 [; kraj=1]])"

#: functions/statistical.xml:150
msgid "BETADIST(BETAINV(0.1;3;4);3;4) equals 0.1"
msgstr "BETADIST(BETAINV(0.1;3;4);3;4) jednako 0.1"

#: functions/statistical.xml:151
msgid "BETADIST(BETAINV(0.3;3;4);3;4) equals 0.3"
msgstr "BETADIST(BETAINV(0.3;3;4);3;4) jednako 0.3"

#: functions/statistical.xml:164
msgid "Degrees of freedom"
msgstr "Stepeni slobode"

#: functions/statistical.xml:168
msgid ""
"The CHIDIST() function returns the probability value from the indicated Chi "
"square that a hypothesis is confirmed."
msgstr ""
"Funkcija CHIDIST() vraća vrijednost vjerovatnoće iz navedenog Chi kvadrata "
"da je hipoteza potvrđena."

#: functions/statistical.xml:169
msgid ""
"CHIDIST compares the Chi square value to be given for a random sample that "
"is calculated from the sum of (observed value-expected value)^2/expected "
"value for all values with the theoretical Chi square distribution and "
"determines from this the probability of error for the hypothesis to be "
"tested."
msgstr ""
"Funkcija CHIDIST upoređuje Chi kvadratnu vrijednost zadatu za slučajan "
"uzorak koji se računa iz sume (primijećena vrijednost - očekivana vrijednost)"
"^2 / očekivana vrijednost za sve vrijednosti sa teoretskom Chi kvadratnom "
"distribucijom i određuje iz ovoga verovatnoću greške za hipotezu koja se "
"testira."

#: functions/statistical.xml:170
msgid "CHIDIST(number;degrees_freedom)"
msgstr "CHIDIST(broja;st.slobode)"

#: functions/statistical.xml:171
msgid "CHIDIST(13.27;5) returns 0.021"
msgstr "CHIDIST(13.27;5) vraća 0.021"

#: functions/statistical.xml:179 functions/statistical.xml:198
#: functions/statistical.xml:931 functions/statistical.xml:950
msgid "Total number of elements"
msgstr "Ukupan broj elemenata"

#: functions/statistical.xml:183 functions/statistical.xml:202
#: functions/statistical.xml:954
msgid "Number of elements to choose"
msgstr "Broj elemenata koje treba izabrati"

#: functions/statistical.xml:187
msgid ""
"The COMBIN() function calculates the count of possible combinations. The "
"first parameter is the total count of elements. The second parameter is the "
"count of elements to choose. Both parameters should be positive and the "
"first parameter should not be less than the second. Otherwise the function "
"returns an error."
msgstr ""
"Funkcija COMBIN() računa broj mogućih kombinacija. Prvi parametar je ukupan "
"broj elemenata. Drugi parametar je broj elemenata koje treba izabrati. Oba "
"parametra treba da budu pozitivna i prvi ne bi trebalo da je manji od "
"drugog. U suprotnom, funkcija će vratiti grešku."

#: functions/statistical.xml:188 functions/statistical.xml:207
msgid "COMBIN(total;chosen)"
msgstr "COMBIN(ukupno;izabrano)"

#: functions/statistical.xml:189 functions/statistical.xml:208
msgid "COMBIN(12;5) returns 792"
msgstr "COMBIN(12;5) vraća 792"

#: functions/statistical.xml:190 functions/statistical.xml:209
msgid "COMBIN(5;5) returns 1"
msgstr "COMBIN(5;5) vraća 1"

#: functions/statistical.xml:206
msgid ""
"The COMBINA() function calculates the count of possible combinations. The "
"first parameter is the total count of elements. The second parameter is the "
"count of elements to choose. Both parameters should be positive and the "
"first parameter should not be less than the second. Otherwise the function "
"returns an error."
msgstr ""
"COMBINA() funkcija računa broj mogućih kombinacija.Prvi parametar je ukupan "
"broj elemenata,Drugi parametar je broj elemenata za izbor.Oba parametra "
"trebaju biti pozitivna i prvi parametar ne bi trebao biti manji od drugog."
"Inače funkcija će vratiti grešku."

#: functions/statistical.xml:217
msgid "Level of the confidence interval"
msgstr "Nivo intervala povjerenja"

#: functions/statistical.xml:221
msgid "Standard deviation for the total population"
msgstr "Standardna devijacija za ukupnu populaciju"

#: functions/statistical.xml:225
msgid "Size of the total population"
msgstr "Veličina ukupne populacije"

#: functions/statistical.xml:229
msgid ""
"The CONFIDENCE() function returns the confidence interval for a population "
"mean."
msgstr ""
"Funkcije CONFIDENCE() vraća interval povjerenja za srednju vrijednost "
"populacije."

#: functions/statistical.xml:230
msgid ""
"The alpha parameter must be between 0 and 1 (non-inclusive), stddev must be "
"positive and size must be greater or equal to 1."
msgstr ""
"Alfa parametar mora da bude između 0 i 1 (ekskluzivno), st.div. mora da bude "
"pozitivna, a veličina veća ili jednaka 1."

#: functions/statistical.xml:231
msgid "CONFIDENCE(alpha;stddev;size)"
msgstr "CONFIDENCE(alfa;st.div.;veličina)"

#: functions/statistical.xml:232
msgid "CONFIDENCE(0.05;1.5;100) equals 0.294059"
msgstr "CONFIDENCE(0.05;1.5;100) je 0.294059"

#: functions/statistical.xml:240 functions/statistical.xml:259
#: functions/statistical.xml:667 functions/statistical.xml:912
#: functions/statistical.xml:1143
msgid "Cell range of values"
msgstr "Ćelijski opseg vrijednosti"

#: functions/statistical.xml:244 functions/statistical.xml:263
#: functions/statistical.xml:916
msgid "Second cell range of values"
msgstr "Drugi ćelijski opseg vrijednosti"

#: functions/statistical.xml:248
msgid ""
"The CORREL() function calculates the correlation coefficient of two cell "
"ranges."
msgstr "Funkcija CORREL() računa korelacioni koeficijent dva ćelijska opsega."

#: functions/statistical.xml:249
msgid "CORREL(range1; range2)"
msgstr "CORREL(opseg1; opseg2)"

#: functions/statistical.xml:250
msgid "CORREL(A1:A3; B1:B3)"
msgstr "CORREL(A1:A3; B1:B3)"

#: functions/statistical.xml:267
msgid "The COVAR() function calculates the covariance of two cell ranges."
msgstr "Funkcija COVAR() računa kovarijansu dva ćelijska opsega."

#: functions/statistical.xml:268
msgid "COVAR(range1; range2)"
msgstr "COVAR(opseg1; opseg2)"

#: functions/statistical.xml:269
msgid "COVAR(A1:A3; B1:B3)"
msgstr "COVAR(A1:A3; B1:B3)"

#: functions/statistical.xml:297
msgid "The DEVSQ() function calculates the sum of squares of deviations."
msgstr "Funkcija DEVSQ() računa sumu kvadrata devijacija."

#: functions/statistical.xml:298
msgid "DEVSQ(value; value;...)"
msgstr "DEVSQ(vrijednost; vrijednost;...)"

#: functions/statistical.xml:299
msgid "DEVSQ(A1:A5)"
msgstr "DEVSQ(A1:A5)"

#: functions/statistical.xml:300
msgid "DEVSQ(21; 33; 54; 23) returns 684.75"
msgstr "DEVSQ(21; 33; 54; 23) vraća 684.75"

#: functions/statistical.xml:312
msgid "Lambda parameter"
msgstr "Lambda parametar"

#: functions/statistical.xml:316 functions/statistical.xml:843
#: functions/statistical.xml:1010 functions/statistical.xml:1677
msgid "0 = density, 1 = distribution"
msgstr "0 = gustina, 1 = distribucija"

#: functions/statistical.xml:320
msgid "The EXPONDIST() function returns the exponential distribution."
msgstr "Funkcija EXPONDIST() vraća eksponencijalnu distribuciju."

#: functions/statistical.xml:321
msgid "The lambda parameter must be positive."
msgstr "Lambda parametar mora da bude pozitivan."

#: functions/statistical.xml:322 functions/statistical.xml:1016
#: functions/statistical.xml:1683
msgid ""
"Cumulative = 0 calculates the density function; cumulative = 1 calculates "
"the distribution."
msgstr ""
"Kumulativno = 0 računa funkciju gustine; kumulativno = 1 računa distribuciju."

#: functions/statistical.xml:323
msgid "EXPONDIST(number;lambda;cumulative)"
msgstr "EXPONDIST(broj;lambda;kumulativno)"

#: functions/statistical.xml:324
msgid "EXPONDIST(3;0.5;0) equals 0.111565"
msgstr "EXPONDIST(3;0.5;0) je 0.111565"

#: functions/statistical.xml:325
msgid "EXPONDIST(3;0.5;1) equals 0.776870"
msgstr "EXPONDIST(3;0.5;1) je 0.776870"

#: functions/statistical.xml:337 functions/statistical.xml:689
msgid "Degrees of freedom 1"
msgstr "Stepeni slobode 1"

#: functions/statistical.xml:341 functions/statistical.xml:693
msgid "Degrees of freedom 2"
msgstr "Stepeni slobode 2"

#: functions/statistical.xml:345
msgid "The FDIST() function returns the f-distribution."
msgstr "Funkcija FDIST() vraća f-distribuciju."

#: functions/statistical.xml:346
msgid "FDIST(number;degrees_freedom_1;degrees_freedom_2)"
msgstr "FDIST(broj;st.slob.1;st.slob.2)"

#: functions/statistical.xml:347
msgid "FDIST(0.8;8;12) yields 0.61"
msgstr "FDIST(0.8;8;12) daje 0.61"

#: functions/statistical.xml:359
msgid "Number r1"
msgstr "Broj r1"

#: functions/statistical.xml:363
msgid "Number r2"
msgstr "Broj r2"

#: functions/statistical.xml:367
msgid ""
"The FINV() function returns the unique non-negative number x such that FDIST"
"(x;r1;r2) = p."
msgstr ""
"FINV() funkcija vraća jedinstven ne-negativan broj x takav da FDIST(x;r1;r2) "
"= p."

#: functions/statistical.xml:368
msgid "FINV(number; r1; r2)"
msgstr "FINV(broj; r1; r2)"

#: functions/statistical.xml:369
msgid "FDIST(FINV(0.1;3;4);3;4) equals 0.1"
msgstr "FDIST(FINV(0.1;3;4);3;4) jednako 0.1"

#: functions/statistical.xml:381
msgid ""
"The FISHER() function returns the Fisher transformation for x and creates a "
"function close to a normal distribution."
msgstr ""
"Funkcija FISHER() vraća Fišerovu transformaciju za x i pravi funkciju blisku "
"normalnoj distribuciji."

#: functions/statistical.xml:382
msgid "FISHER(number)"
msgstr "FISHER(broj)"

#: functions/statistical.xml:383
msgid "FISHER(0.2859) equals 0.294096"
msgstr "FISHER(0.2859) je 0.294096"

#: functions/statistical.xml:384
msgid "FISHER(0.8105) equals 1.128485"
msgstr "FISHER(0.8105) je 1.128485"

#: functions/statistical.xml:396
msgid ""
"The FISHERINV() function returns the inverse of the Fisher transformation "
"for x and creates a function close to a normal distribution."
msgstr ""
"Funkcija FISHERINV() vraća inverz Fišerove transformacije za x i pravi "
"funkciju blisku normalnoj distribuciji."

#: functions/statistical.xml:397
msgid "FISHERINV(number)"
msgstr "FISHERINV(broj)"

#: functions/statistical.xml:398
msgid "FISHERINV(0.2859) equals 0.278357"
msgstr "FISHERINV(0.2859) je 0.278357"

#: functions/statistical.xml:399
msgid "FISHERINV(0.8105) equals 0.669866"
msgstr "FISHERINV(0.8105) je 0.669866"

#: functions/statistical.xml:407
msgid "Floating point values, that should be counted."
msgstr "Vrijednost sa pomičnim zarezom,to treba brojati"

#: functions/statistical.xml:411
msgid ""
"Floating point values, representing the upper boundaries of the intervals."
msgstr ""
"Vrijednost sa pomičnim zarezom,predstavlja gornju granicu za intervale."

#: functions/statistical.xml:415
msgid ""
"Counts the number of values for each interval given by the border values in "
"the second parameter."
msgstr ""
"Brojač broj vrijednosti za svaki interval dajući granične vrijednosti u "
"drugi parametar."

#: functions/statistical.xml:420
msgid ""
"The values in the second parameter determine the upper boundaries of the "
"intervals.\n"
"               The intervals include the upper boundaries.\n"
"               The returned array is a column vector and has one more "
"element than the second parameter;\n"
"               the last element represents the number of all elements "
"greater than the last value in second parameter.\n"
"                   If the second parameter is empty, all values in the first "
"parameter are counted."
msgstr ""
"Vrijednosti u drugom parametru određujui gornje granice intervala.\n"
"               Intervali uključuju gornje granice.\n"
"               Vratio polje je stupac vektora i ima još jedan elemenat od "
"drugog parametra;\n"
"               zadnji element koji predstavlja broj svih elemenata je veći "
"nego prošle vrijednosti u drugom parametru.\n"
"                   Ako je drugi parametar je prazna, sve vrijednosti u prvom "
"parametru se broje."

#: functions/statistical.xml:421
msgid "FREQUENCY(Range data; Range bins)"
msgstr "FREQUENCY(Opseg podataka; Opseg prostora)"

#: functions/statistical.xml:441
msgid "Cumulated flag"
msgstr "Kumulativna zastavica"

#: functions/statistical.xml:445
msgid "The GAMMADIST() function returns the gamma distribution."
msgstr "Funkcija GAMMADIST() vraća gama-distribuciju."

#: functions/statistical.xml:446
msgid ""
"If the last parameter (cumulated) is 0, it calculates the density function; "
"if it's 1, the distribution is returned."
msgstr ""
"Ako je posljednji parametar (kumulativno) 0, računa se funkcija gustine; ako "
"je 1, vraća se distribucija."

#: functions/statistical.xml:447
msgid "The first three parameters must be positive."
msgstr "Prva tri parametra moraju da budu pozitivna."

#: functions/statistical.xml:448
msgid "GAMMADIST(number;alpha;beta;cumulated)"
msgstr "GAMMADIST(broj;alfa;beta;kumulativno)"

#: functions/statistical.xml:449
msgid "GAMMADIST(0.758;0.1;0.35;1) equals 0.995450"
msgstr "GAMMADIST(0.758;0.1;0.35;1) je 0.995450"

#: functions/statistical.xml:450
msgid "GAMMADIST(0.758;0.1;0.35;0) equals 0.017179"
msgstr "GAMMADIST(0.758;0.1;0.35;0) je 0.017179"

#: functions/statistical.xml:470
msgid ""
"The GAMMAINV() function returns the unique number x >= 0 such that GAMMAINV"
"(x;alpha;beta;TRUE()) = p."
msgstr ""
"GAMMAINV() funkcija vraća jedinstven broj x>=0 takav da je GAMMAINV(x;alfa;"
"beta;TAČNO()) = p."

#: functions/statistical.xml:471
msgid "GAMMAINV(number;alpha;beta)"
msgstr "GAMMAINV(broj;alfa;beta)"

#: functions/statistical.xml:472
msgid "GAMMADIST(GAMMAINV(0.1;3;4);3;4) equals 0.1"
msgstr "GAMMADIST(GAMMAINV(0.1;3;4);3;4) jednako 0.1"

#: functions/statistical.xml:473
msgid "GAMMADIST(GAMMAINV(0.3;3;4);3;4) equals 0.3"
msgstr "GAMMADIST(GAMMAINV(0.3;3;4);3;4) jednako 0.3"

#: functions/statistical.xml:482
msgid ""
"The number for which the integral value of standard normal distribution is "
"to be calculated"
msgstr ""
"Broj za koji treba da se izračuna integralna vrijednost standardne normalne "
"distribucije"

#: functions/statistical.xml:486
msgid ""
"The GAUSS() function returns the integral values for the standard normal "
"cumulative distribution."
msgstr ""
"Funkcija GAUSS() vraća integralne vrijednosti za standardnu normalnu "
"kumulativnu distribuciju."

#: functions/statistical.xml:487
msgid "GAUSS(value)"
msgstr "GAUSS(vrijednost)"

#: functions/statistical.xml:488
msgid "GAUSS(0.25) equals 0.098706"
msgstr "GAUSS(0.25) je 0.098706"

#: functions/statistical.xml:516
msgid ""
"The GEOMEAN() function returns the geometric mean of the given arguments. "
"This is equal to the Nth root of the product of the terms."
msgstr ""
"Funkcija GEOMEAN() vraća geometrijsku sredinu datig argumenata. Ovo je "
"jednako N-tom korijenu proizvoda činioca."

#: functions/statistical.xml:517
msgid "GEOMEAN(value; value;...)"
msgstr "GEOMEAN(vrijednost; vrijednost;...)"

#: functions/statistical.xml:518
msgid "GEOMEAN(A1:A5)"
msgstr "GEOMEAN(A1:A5)"

#: functions/statistical.xml:519
msgid "GEOMEAN(21; 33; 54; 23) returns 30.45886"
msgstr "GEOMEAN(21; 33; 54; 23) vraća 30.45886"

#: functions/statistical.xml:548
msgid ""
"The HARMEAN() function returns the harmonic mean of the N data points (N "
"divided by the sum of the inverses of the data points)."
msgstr ""
"Funkcija HARMEAN() vraća harmonijsku sredinu N vrijednosti (N podeljeno sa "
"sumom inverza brojeva)."

#: functions/statistical.xml:549
msgid "HARMEAN(value; value;...)"
msgstr "HARMEAN(vrijednost; vrijednost;...)"

#: functions/statistical.xml:550
msgid "HARMEAN(A1:A5)"
msgstr "HARMEAN(A1:A5)"

#: functions/statistical.xml:551
msgid "HARMEAN(21; 33; 54; 23) returns 28.588"
msgstr "HARMEAN(21; 33; 54; 23) vraća 28.588"

#: functions/statistical.xml:560
msgid "Number of success in the sample"
msgstr "Broj uspjeha u uzorku"

#: functions/statistical.xml:564 functions/statistical.xml:1756
#: functions/statistical.xml:1797
msgid "Number of trials"
msgstr "Broj pokušaja"

#: functions/statistical.xml:568
msgid "Number of success overall"
msgstr "Ukupan broj uspjeha"

#: functions/statistical.xml:572
msgid "Population size"
msgstr "Veličina populacije"

#: functions/statistical.xml:576
msgid "The HYPGEOMDIST() function returns the hypergeometric distribution."
msgstr "Funkcija HYPGEOMDIST() vraća hipergeometrijsku distribuciju."

#: functions/statistical.xml:577
msgid "HYPGEOMDIST(x; n; M; N)"
msgstr "HYPGEOMDIST(x; n; M; N)"

#: functions/statistical.xml:578
msgid "HYPGEOMDIST(2; 5; 6; 20) returns 0.3522"
msgstr "HYPGEOMDIST(2; 5; 6; 20) vraća 0.3522"

#: functions/statistical.xml:586 functions/statistical.xml:1126
#: functions/statistical.xml:1312
msgid "y values (array)"
msgstr "y vrijednost (niz)"

#: functions/statistical.xml:590 functions/statistical.xml:1130
#: functions/statistical.xml:1316
msgid "x values (array)"
msgstr "X vrijednost (niz)"

#: functions/statistical.xml:594
msgid ""
"The INTERCEPT() function calculates the interception of the linear "
"regression line with the y axis."
msgstr ""
"INTERCEPT() funkcija izračunava presretanje linearne regresije u skladu s y "
"osom."

#: functions/statistical.xml:595
msgid "INTERCEPT(y;x)"
msgstr "INTERCEPT(y;x)"

#: functions/statistical.xml:623
msgid ""
"The KURT() function calculates an unbiased estimate of the kurtosis of a "
"data set. You have to provide at least 4 values, otherwise an error is "
"returned."
msgstr ""
"Funkcija KURT() računa nepristrasnu procjenu kurtoze skupa podataka. Morate "
"da navedete bar četiri vrijednosti, inače će funkcija vratiti grešku."

#: functions/statistical.xml:624
msgid "KURT(value; value;...)"
msgstr "KURT(vrijednost; vrijednost;...)"

#: functions/statistical.xml:625
msgid "KURT(A1:A5)"
msgstr "KURT(A1:A5)"

#: functions/statistical.xml:626
msgid "KURT(21; 33; 54; 23) returns 1.344239"
msgstr "KURT(21; 33; 54; 23) vraća 1.344239"

#: functions/statistical.xml:655
msgid ""
"The KURTP() function calculates an population kurtosis of a data set. You "
"have to provide at least 4 values, otherwise an error is returned."
msgstr ""
"Funkcija KURTP() računa populacionu kurtozu skupa podataka. Morate da "
"navedete bar četiri vrijednosti, inače će funkcija vratiti grešku."

#: functions/statistical.xml:656
msgid "KURTP(value; value;...)"
msgstr "KURTP(vrijednost; vrijednost;...)"

#: functions/statistical.xml:657
msgid "KURTP(A1:A5)"
msgstr "KURTP(A1:A5)"

#: functions/statistical.xml:658
msgid "KURTP(21; 33; 54; 23) returns -1.021"
msgstr "KURTP(21; 33; 54; 23) vraća -1.021"

#: functions/statistical.xml:671
msgid "Position (from the largest)"
msgstr "Položaj (u odnosu na najveći)"

#: functions/statistical.xml:675
msgid "The LARGE() function returns the k-th largest value from the data set."
msgstr "Funkcija LARGE() vraća k-tu najveću vrijednost iz skupa podataka."

#: functions/statistical.xml:676
msgid "LARGE(range; k)"
msgstr "LARGE(opseg; k)"

#: functions/statistical.xml:677
msgid "A1: 3, A2: 1, A3: 5 => LARGE(A1:A3; 2) returns 3"
msgstr "A1: 3, A2: 1, A3: 5 => LARGE(A1:A3; 2) vraća 3"

#: functions/statistical.xml:697
msgid "The LEGACYFDIST() function returns the f-distribution."
msgstr "LEGACYFDIST() funkcija vraća f-raspodjelu."

#: functions/statistical.xml:698
msgid "LEGACYFDIST(number;degrees_freedom_1;degrees_freedom_2)"
msgstr "LEGACYFDIST(broj,stepen_slobode_1;stepen_slobode_2)"

#: functions/statistical.xml:699
msgid "LEGACYFDIST(0.8;8;12) yields 0.61"
msgstr "LEGACYFDIST(0.8;8;12) prinosa 0.61"

#: functions/statistical.xml:707
msgid "Probability"
msgstr "Verovatnoća"

#: functions/statistical.xml:711 functions/statistical.xml:733
msgid "Mean value of the standard logarithmic distribution"
msgstr "Srednja vrijednost standardne logaritamske distribucije"

#: functions/statistical.xml:715 functions/statistical.xml:737
msgid "Standard deviation of the standard logarithmic distribution"
msgstr "Standardna devijacija standardne logaritamske distribucije"

#: functions/statistical.xml:719
msgid ""
"The LOGINV() function returns the inverse of the lognormal cumulative "
"distribution."
msgstr "Funkcija LOGINV() vraća inverz lognormalne kumulativne distribucije."

#: functions/statistical.xml:720
msgid "LOGINV(p; mean; stdev)"
msgstr "LOGINV(p; sred.vrijed.; st.div.)"

#: functions/statistical.xml:721
msgid "LOGINV(0.1;0;1) equals 0.2776"
msgstr "LOGINV(0.1;0;1) je 0.2776"

#: functions/statistical.xml:729 functions/statistical.xml:862
msgid ""
"Probability value for which the standard logarithmic distribution is to be "
"calculated"
msgstr ""
"Vrijednost verovatnoće za koju treba da se izračuna standardna logaritamska "
"distribucija"

#: functions/statistical.xml:741
msgid ""
"The LOGNORMDIST() function returns the cumulative lognormal distribution."
msgstr "Funkcija LOGNORMDIST() vraća kumulativnu lognormalnu distribuciju."

#: functions/statistical.xml:742
msgid "LOGNORMDIST(Number;MV;STD)"
msgstr "LOGNORMDIST(broj;MV;STD)"

#: functions/statistical.xml:743
msgid "LOGNORMDIST(0.1;0;1) equals 0.01"
msgstr "LOGNORMDIST(0.1;0;1) je 0.01"

#: functions/statistical.xml:751
msgid "Floating point value or range of values"
msgstr "Realna vrijednost ili opseg vrijednosti"

#: functions/statistical.xml:755 functions/statistical.xml:759
#: functions/statistical.xml:763 functions/statistical.xml:767
msgid "Floating point values or range of values"
msgstr "Realne vrijednosti ili opseg vrijednosti"

#: functions/statistical.xml:771
msgid ""
"The MEDIAN() function calculates the median of all the values given as "
"parameters. You can calculate the median of a range like MEDIAN(A1:B5) or a "
"list of values like MEDIAN(12; 5; 12.5). Blank cells will be considered as a "
"zero, and cells with text will be ignored."
msgstr ""
"Funkcija MEDIAN() računa medijan svih vrijednosti datih kao parametri. "
"Možete računati medijan opsega, kao MEDIAN(A1:B5), ili liste vrijednosti, "
"kao MEDIAN(12; 5; 12.5). Prazne ćelije se računaju kao nula, a ćelije koje "
"sadrže tekst biće ignorisane."

#: functions/statistical.xml:772
msgid "MEDIAN(value;value;...)"
msgstr "MEDIAN(vrijednost;vrijednost;...)"

#: functions/statistical.xml:773
msgid "MEDIAN(12; 5; 5.5) equals 5.5"
msgstr "MEDIAN(12; 5; 5.5) je 5.5"

#: functions/statistical.xml:774
msgid "MEDIAN(12; 7; 8;2) equals 7.5"
msgstr "MEDIAN(12; 7; 8;2) je 7.5"

#: functions/statistical.xml:782 functions/statistical.xml:786
#: functions/statistical.xml:790 functions/statistical.xml:794
#: functions/statistical.xml:1070 functions/statistical.xml:1074
#: functions/statistical.xml:1078 functions/statistical.xml:1082
#: functions/statistical.xml:1098 functions/statistical.xml:1102
#: functions/statistical.xml:1106 functions/statistical.xml:1110
msgid "Float"
msgstr "Realan broj"

#: functions/statistical.xml:798
msgid ""
"The MODE() function returns the most frequently occurring value in the data "
"set."
msgstr "MODE() funkcija vraća najviše korištenu vrijednost u skupu podataka."

#: functions/statistical.xml:799
msgid "MODE(number; number2; ...)"
msgstr "MODE(broj1; broj2; ...)"

#: functions/statistical.xml:800
msgid "MODE(range)"
msgstr "MODE(opseg)"

#: functions/statistical.xml:801
msgid "MODE(12; 14; 12; 15) returns 12"
msgstr "MODE(12; 14; 12; 15) vraća 12"

#: functions/statistical.xml:809 functions/statistical.xml:1801
msgid "Number of failures"
msgstr "Broj neuspješnih pokušaja"

#: functions/statistical.xml:813 functions/statistical.xml:1760
msgid "Number of successful trials"
msgstr "Broj uspješnih pokušaja"

#: functions/statistical.xml:817 functions/statistical.xml:1764
msgid "Probability of success"
msgstr "Vjerovatnoća uspjeha"

#: functions/statistical.xml:821
msgid "The NEGBINOMDIST() function returns the negative binomial distribution."
msgstr "Funkcija NEGBINOMDIST() vraća negativnu binomijalnu distribuciju."

#: functions/statistical.xml:822
msgid "NEGBINOMDIST(failures; success; prob_of_success)"
msgstr "NEGBINOMDIST(neuspesi; uspesi; vir.uspjeha)"

#: functions/statistical.xml:823
msgid "NEGBINOMDIST(2;5;0.55) returns 0.152872629"
msgstr "NEGBINOMDIST(2;5;0.55) vraća 0.152872629"

#: functions/statistical.xml:835
msgid "Linear middle of the distribution"
msgstr "Linearna sredina distribucije"

#: functions/statistical.xml:839
msgid "Standard deviation of the distribution"
msgstr "Standardna devijacija distribucije"

#: functions/statistical.xml:847
msgid "The NORMDIST() function returns the normal cumulative distribution."
msgstr "Funkcija NORMDIST() vraća normalnu kumulativnu distribuciju."

#: functions/statistical.xml:848
msgid ""
"Number is the value of the distribution based on which the normal "
"distribution is to be calculated."
msgstr ""
"Broj je vrijednost distribucije na osnovu koje se računa normalna "
"distribucija."

#: functions/statistical.xml:849
msgid "MV is the linear middle of the distribution."
msgstr "MV je linearna sredina distribucije."

#: functions/statistical.xml:850
msgid "STD is the standard deviation of the distribution."
msgstr "STD je standardna devijacija distribucije."

#: functions/statistical.xml:851
msgid ""
"K = 0 calculates the density function; K = 1 calculates the distribution."
msgstr "K = 0 računa funkciju gustine; K = 1 računa distribuciju."

#: functions/statistical.xml:852
msgid "NORMDIST(Number;MV;STD;K)"
msgstr "NORMDIST(broj;MV;STD;K)"

#: functions/statistical.xml:853
msgid "NORMDIST(0.859;0.6;0.258;0) equals 0.934236"
msgstr "NORMDIST(0.859;0.6;0.258;0) je 0.934236"

#: functions/statistical.xml:854
msgid "NORMDIST(0.859;0.6;0.258;1) equals 0.842281"
msgstr "NORMDIST(0.859;0.6;0.258;1) je 0.842281"

#: functions/statistical.xml:866
msgid "Middle value in the normal distribution"
msgstr "Srednja vrijednost u normalnoj distribuciji"

#: functions/statistical.xml:870
msgid "Standard deviation of the normal distribution"
msgstr "Standardna devijacija normalne distribucije"

#: functions/statistical.xml:874
msgid ""
"The NORMINV() function returns the inverse of the normal cumulative "
"distribution. The number must be between 0 and 1 (non-inclusive) and STD "
"must be positive."
msgstr ""
"Funkcija NORMINV() vraća inverz normalne kumulativne distribucije. Broj mora "
"da bude između 0 i 1 (ekskluzivno), a STD mora biti pozitivno."

#: functions/statistical.xml:875
msgid "NORMINV(number;MV;STD)"
msgstr "NORMINV(broj;MV;STD)"

#: functions/statistical.xml:876
msgid "NORMINV(0.9;63;5) equals 69.41"
msgstr "NORMINV(0.9;63;5) je 69.41"

#: functions/statistical.xml:884
msgid "Value to which the standard normal distribution is calculated"
msgstr "Vrijednost za koju se računa standardna normalna distribucija"

#: functions/statistical.xml:888
msgid "The NORMSDIST() function returns the standard normal distribution."
msgstr "Funkcija NORMSDIST() vraća standardnu normalnu distribuciju."

#: functions/statistical.xml:889
msgid "NORMSDIST(Number)"
msgstr "NORMSDIST(broj)"

#: functions/statistical.xml:890
msgid "NORMSDIST(1) equals 0.84"
msgstr "NORMSDIST(1) je 0.84"

#: functions/statistical.xml:902
msgid ""
"The NORMSINV() function returns the inverse of the standard normal "
"cumulative distribution. The number must be between 0 and 1 (non-inclusive)."
msgstr ""
"Funkcija NORMSINV() vraća inveru standardne normalne kumulativne "
"distribucije. Broj mora da bude između 0 i 1 (ekskluzivno)."

#: functions/statistical.xml:903
msgid "NORMSINV(Number)"
msgstr "NORMSINV(broj)"

#: functions/statistical.xml:904
msgid "NORMSINV(0.908789) returns 1.3333"
msgstr "NORMSINV(0.908789) vraća 1.3333"

#: functions/statistical.xml:920
msgid ""
"The PEARSON() function calculates the correlation coefficient of two cell "
"ranges. It is the same as the CORREL function."
msgstr ""
"Funkcija PEARSON() računa korelacioni koeficijent dva ćelijska opsega. Isto "
"kao CORREL."

#: functions/statistical.xml:921
msgid "PEARSON(range1; range2)"
msgstr "PEARSON(opseg1; opseg2)"

#: functions/statistical.xml:922
msgid "PEARSON(A1:A3; B1:B3)"
msgstr "PEARSON(A1:A3; B1:B3)"

#: functions/statistical.xml:935
msgid "Number of elements to permutate"
msgstr "Broj elemenata koje treba permutovati"

#: functions/statistical.xml:939
msgid ""
"The PERMUT() function returns the number of permutations. The first "
"parameter is the number of elements, and the second parameter is the number "
"of elements used in the permutation."
msgstr ""
"Funkcija PERMUT() vraća broj permutacija. Prvi parametar je broj elemenata, "
"a drugi je broj elemenata koji se koriste u permutaciji."

#: functions/statistical.xml:940
msgid "PERMUT(total;permutated)"
msgstr "PERMUT(ukupno;permutovano)"

#: functions/statistical.xml:941
msgid "PERMUT(8;5) equals 6720"
msgstr "PERMUT(8;5) je 6720"

#: functions/statistical.xml:942
msgid "PERMUT(1;1) equals 1"
msgstr "PERMUT(1;1) je 1"

#: functions/statistical.xml:958
msgid ""
"The PERMUTATIONA() function returns the number of ordered permutations when "
"allowing repetition. The first parameter is the number of elements, and the "
"second parameter is the number of elements to choose. Both parameters must "
"be positive."
msgstr ""
"Funkcija PERMUTATIONA() vraća broj uređenih permutacija s ponavljanjem. Prvi "
"parametar je broj elemenata, a drugi parametar je broj elemenata za "
"izabrati. Oba parametri moraju biti pozitivna."

#: functions/statistical.xml:959
msgid "PERMUTATIONA(total;chosen)"
msgstr "PERMUTATIONA(total;izabrano)"

#: functions/statistical.xml:960
msgid "PERMUTATIONA(2,3) returns 8"
msgstr "PERMUTATIONA(2,3) vraća 8"

#: functions/statistical.xml:961
msgid "PERMUTATIONA(0,0) returns 1"
msgstr "PERMUTATIONA(0,0) vraća 1"

#: functions/statistical.xml:969
msgid "Range of values"
msgstr "Opseg pretrage"

#: functions/statistical.xml:973
msgid "The percentile value between 0 and 1, inclusive."
msgstr "Procentualna vrijednost između 0 i 1, uključivo."

#: functions/statistical.xml:977
#, no-c-format
msgid ""
"The PERCENTILE() function returns the x-th sample percentile of data values "
"in Data. A percentile returns the scale value for a data series which goes "
"from the smallest (alpha=0) to the largest value (alpha=1) of a data series. "
"For alpha = 25%, the percentile means the first quartile; alpha = 50% is the "
"MEDIAN. Blank cells will be considered as a zero, and cells with text will "
"be ignored."
msgstr ""
"Funkcija PERCENTILE () vraća x-ti percentil od vrijednosti podataka u Data. "
"Percentil daje skalu vrijednosti podataka koja ide od najmanjih (alfa = 0) "
"da najvećih vrijednosti (alfa = 1) skupa podataka. Za alfa = 25%, znači "
"percentil prvi kvartal, alfa = 50% predstavlja MEDIAN. Prazne ćelije će se "
"smatrati kao nula, a ćelije sa tekst će biti ignorisane."

#: functions/statistical.xml:978
msgid "PERCENTILE(data;alpha)"
msgstr "PERCENTILE(podatak;alfa)"

#: functions/statistical.xml:988
msgid ""
"The number for which the standard normal distribution is to be calculated"
msgstr "Broj za koji treba da se izračuna standardna normalna distribucija"

#: functions/statistical.xml:992
msgid ""
"The PHI() function returns value of the distribution function for a standard "
"normal distribution."
msgstr ""
"Funkcija PHI() vraća vrijednost distribucione funkcije za standardnu "
"normalnu distribuciju."

#: functions/statistical.xml:993
msgid "PHI(value)"
msgstr "PHI(vrijednost)"

#: functions/statistical.xml:994
msgid "PHI(0.25) equals 0.386668"
msgstr "PHI(0.25) je 0.386668"

#: functions/statistical.xml:1006
msgid "Lambda parameter (the middle value)"
msgstr "Lambda parametar (srednja vrijednost)"

#: functions/statistical.xml:1014
msgid "The POISSON() function returns the Poisson distribution."
msgstr "Funkcija POISSON() vraća Poasonovu distribuciju."

#: functions/statistical.xml:1015
msgid "The lambda and number parameters must be positive."
msgstr "Lambda parametar i broj moraju da budu pozitivni."

#: functions/statistical.xml:1017
msgid "POISSON(number;lambda;cumulative)"
msgstr "POISSON(broj;lambda;kumulativno)"

#: functions/statistical.xml:1018
msgid "POISSON(60;50;0) equals 0.020105"
msgstr "POISSON(60;50;0) je 0.020105"

#: functions/statistical.xml:1019
msgid "POISSON(60;50;1) equals 0.927840"
msgstr "POISSON(60;50;1) je 0.927840"

#: functions/statistical.xml:1031
msgid "Data (array)"
msgstr "Podatak (niz)"

#: functions/statistical.xml:1035
msgid "Order"
msgstr "Redoslijed"

#: functions/statistical.xml:1039
msgid "The RANK() function returns the rank of a number in a list of numbers."
msgstr "RANK() funkcija vraća rang broja na listi brojeva."

#: functions/statistical.xml:1040
msgid "Order specifies how to rank the numbers:"
msgstr "Redoslijed specificira kako rangirati brojeve:"

#: functions/statistical.xml:1041
msgid "If 0 or omitted, Data is ranked in descending order."
msgstr "Ako je 0 ili je propuštena,podaci su rangirani u silaznom redoslijedu."

#: functions/statistical.xml:1042
msgid "If not 0, Data is ranked in ascending order."
msgstr "Ako nije 0,podaci su rangirani u uzlaznom redoslijedu."

#: functions/statistical.xml:1043
msgid "RSQ(Value; Data; Order)"
msgstr "RSQ(Vrijednost; Podatak; Poredak)"

#: functions/statistical.xml:1044
msgid "RANK (2;{1;2;3}) equals 2"
msgstr "RANK (2;{1;2;3}) jednako 2"

#: functions/statistical.xml:1052
msgid "known Y (array)"
msgstr "poznat Y (niz)"

#: functions/statistical.xml:1056
msgid "known X (array)"
msgstr "poznat X (niz)"

#: functions/statistical.xml:1060
msgid ""
"The RSQ() function returns the square of the Pearson product moment "
"correlation coefficient through data points in known_y's and known_x's."
msgstr ""
"RSQ() funkcija vraća kvadrat Personovog proizvoda momenta koleracije kroz "
"tačke u known_y's i known_x's."

#: functions/statistical.xml:1061
msgid ""
"If \"arrayY\" and \"arrayX\" are empty or have a different number of data "
"points, then #N/A is returned."
msgstr ""
"Ako su \"arrayY\" i \"arrayX\" prazni ili imaju različit broj tačaka "
"podataka,tada vraća #N/A."

