msgid "SKEW(11.4; 17.3; 21.3; 25.9; 40.1) returns 0.9768"
msgstr "SKEW(11.4; 17.3; 21.3; 25.9; 40.1) vraća 0.9768"

#: functions/statistical.xml:1114
msgid "The SKEWP() function returns the population skewness of a distribution"
msgstr "The SKEWP() vraća populacionu iskrivljenost distribucije"

#: functions/statistical.xml:1115
msgid "SKEWP(number; number2; ...)"
msgstr "SKEWP(broj1; broj2; ...)"

#: functions/statistical.xml:1116
msgid "SKEWP(range)"
msgstr "SKEWP(opseg)"

#: functions/statistical.xml:1117
msgid "SKEWP(11.4; 17.3; 21.3; 25.9; 40.1) returns 0.6552"
msgstr "SKEWP(11.4; 17.3; 21.3; 25.9; 40.1) vraća 0.6552"

#: functions/statistical.xml:1134
msgid ""
"The SLOPE() function calculates the slope of the linear regression line."
msgstr "SLOPE () funkcija izračunava nagib linearne regresije linije."

#: functions/statistical.xml:1135 functions/statistical.xml:1321
msgid "SLOPE(y;x)"
msgstr "SLOPE(y;x)"

#: functions/statistical.xml:1147
msgid "Position (from the smallest)"
msgstr "Položaj (u odnosu na najmanji)"

#: functions/statistical.xml:1151
msgid "The SMALL() function returns the k-th smallest value from the data set."
msgstr "Funkcija SMALL() vraća k-tu najmanju vrijednost iz skupa podataka."

#: functions/statistical.xml:1152
msgid "SMALL(range; k)"
msgstr "SMALL(opseg; k)"

#: functions/statistical.xml:1153
msgid "A1: 3, A2: 1, A3: 5 => SMALL(A1:A3; 1) returns 1"
msgstr "A1: 3, A2: 1, A3: 5 => SMALL(A1:A3; 1) vraća 1"

#: functions/statistical.xml:1161
msgid "Number to be normalized"
msgstr "Broj koji treba normalizovati"

#: functions/statistical.xml:1165
msgid "Mean of the distribution"
msgstr "Srednja vrijednost distribucije"

#: functions/statistical.xml:1169
msgid "Standard deviation"
msgstr "Standardna devijacija"

#: functions/statistical.xml:1173
msgid "The STANDARDIZE() function calculates a normalized value."
msgstr "Funkcija STANDARDIZE() računa normalizovanu vrijednost."

#: functions/statistical.xml:1174
msgid "STANDARDIZE(x; mean, stdev)"
msgstr "STANDARDIZE(x; sred.vr., st.div)"

#: functions/statistical.xml:1175
msgid "STANDARDIZE(4; 3; 7) returns 0.1429"
msgstr "STANDARDIZE(4; 3; 7) vraća 0.1429"

#: functions/statistical.xml:1203
msgid ""
"The STDEV() function returns the estimate standard deviation based on a "
"sample. The standard deviation is a measure of how widely values are "
"dispersed from the average value."
msgstr ""
"Funkcija STDEV() vraća procijenjenu standardnu devijaciju na osnovu uzorka. "
"Standardna devijacija pokazuje koliko široko su vrijednosti raštrkane oko "
"srednje vrijednosti."

#: functions/statistical.xml:1204
msgid "STDEV(value;value;...)"
msgstr "STDEV(vrijednost;vrijednost;...)"

#: functions/statistical.xml:1205
msgid "STDEV(6;7;8) equals 1"
msgstr "STDEV(6;7;8) je 1"

#: functions/statistical.xml:1234
msgid ""
"The STDEVA() function returns the estimate standard deviation based on a "
"sample. The standard deviation is a measure of how widely values are "
"dispersed from the average value. If a referenced cell contains text or "
"contains the boolean value FALSE, it is counted as 0. If the boolean value "
"is TRUE it is counted as 1."
msgstr ""
"Funkcija STDEVA() vraća procijenjenu standardnu devijaciju na osnovu uzorka. "
"Standardna devijacija pokazuje koliko široko su vrijednosti raštrkane oko "
"srednje vrijednosti. Ako referencirana ćelija sadrži tekst ili logičku "
"vrijednost Netačno, računa se kao 0. Ako sadrži logičko Tačno, računa se kao "
"1."

#: functions/statistical.xml:1235
msgid "STDEVA(value;value;...)"
msgstr "STDEVA(vrijednost;vrijednost;...)"

#: functions/statistical.xml:1236
msgid "STDEVA(6; 7; A1; 8) equals 1, if A1 is empty"
msgstr "STDEVA(6; 7; A1; 8) je 1, ako je A1 prazno"

#: functions/statistical.xml:1237
msgid "STDEVA(6; 7; A1; 8) equals 3.109, if A1 is TRUE"
msgstr "STDEVA(6; 7; A1; 8) je 3.109, ako je A1 logičko TAČNO"

#: functions/statistical.xml:1267
msgid ""
"The STDEVP() function returns the standard deviation based on an entire "
"population"
msgstr ""
"Funkcija STDEVP() vraća standardnu devijaciju na osnovu cijele populacije."

#: functions/statistical.xml:1268
msgid "STDEVP(value;value;...)"
msgstr "STDEVP(vrijednost;vrijednost;...)"

#: functions/statistical.xml:1269
msgid "STDEVP(6;7;8) equals 0.816497..."
msgstr "STDEVP(6;7;8) je 0.816497..."

#: functions/statistical.xml:1298
msgid ""
"The STDEVPA() function returns standard deviation based on an entire "
"population. If a referenced cell contains text or contains the boolean value "
"FALSE, it is counted as 0. If the boolean value is TRUE it is counted as 1."
msgstr ""
"Funkcija STDEVPA() vraća standardnu devijaciju na osnovu cijele populacije. "
"Ako referencirana ćelija sadrži tekst ili logičku vrijednost Netačno, računa "
"se kao 0. Ako sadrži logičko Tačno, računa se kao 1."

#: functions/statistical.xml:1299
msgid "STDEVPA(value;value;...)"
msgstr "STDEVPA(vrijednost;vrijednost;...)"

#: functions/statistical.xml:1300
msgid "STDEVPA(6; 7; A1; 8) equals 0.816497..., if A1 is empty"
msgstr "STDEVPA(6; 7; A1; 8) je 0.816497..., ako je A1 prazno"

#: functions/statistical.xml:1301
msgid "STDEVPA(6; 7; A1; 8) equals 2.69..., if A1 is TRUE"
msgstr "STDEVPA(6; 7; A1; 8) je 2.69..., ako je A1 logičko TAČNO"

#: functions/statistical.xml:1302
msgid "STDEVPA(6; 7; A1; 8) equals 3.11..., if A1 is FALSE"
msgstr "STDEVPA(6; 7; A1; 8) je 3.11..., ako je A1 logičko NETAČNO"

#: functions/statistical.xml:1320
msgid ""
"The STEYX() function calculates the standard error of the predicted y value "
"for each x in the regression."
msgstr ""
"STEYX() funkcija računa standardnu grešku predviđenu za vrijednost y za "
"svaki x u regresiji."

#: functions/statistical.xml:1337 functions/statistical.xml:1341
#: functions/statistical.xml:1355 functions/statistical.xml:1359
#: functions/statistical.xml:1373 functions/statistical.xml:1377
#: functions/statistical.xml:1779 functions/statistical.xml:1783
msgid "Value (array)"
msgstr "Vrijednost (niz)"

#: functions/statistical.xml:1345
msgid ""
"The SUMPRODUCT() function (SUM(X*Y)) returns the sum of the product of these "
"values. The number of values in the two arrays should be equal. Otherwise "
"this function returns Err."
msgstr ""
"Funkcija SUMPRODUCT() (SUM(X*Y)) vraća sumu proizvoda ovih vrijednosti. Broj "
"vrijednosti u ova dva niza treba da je jednak. U suprotnom, funkcija će "
"vratiti grešku."

#: functions/statistical.xml:1346
msgid "SUMPRODUCT(array1;array2)"
msgstr "SUMPRODUCT(niz1;niz2)"

#: functions/statistical.xml:1347
msgid "SUMPRODUCT(A1:A2;B1:B2) with A1=2, A2=5, B1=3 and B2=5, returns 31"
msgstr "SUMPRODUCT(A1:A2;B1:B2) gdje je A1=2, A2=5, B1=3 i B2=5, vraća 31"

#: functions/statistical.xml:1363
msgid ""
"The SUMX2PY2() function (SUM(X^2+Y^2)) returns the sum of the squares of "
"these values. The number of values in the two arrays should be equal. "
"Otherwise this function returns Err."
msgstr ""
"Funkcija SUMX2PY2() (SUM(X^2+Y^2)) vraća sumu kvadrata datih vrijednosti. "
"Broj vrijednosti u ova dva niza treba da je jednak. U suprotnom, funkcija će "
"vratiti grešku."

#: functions/statistical.xml:1364
msgid "SUMX2PY2(array1;array2)"
msgstr "SUMX2PY2(niz1;niz2)"

#: functions/statistical.xml:1365
msgid "SUMX2PY2(A1:A2;B1:B2) with A1=2, A2=5, B1=3 and B2=5, returns 63"
msgstr "SUMX2PY2(A1:A2;B1:B2) gdje je A1=2, A2=5, B1=3 i B2=5, vraća 63"

#: functions/statistical.xml:1381
msgid ""
"The SUMX2MY2() function (SUM(X^2-Y^2)) returns the difference of the squares "
"of these values. The number of values in the two arrays should be equal. "
"Otherwise this function returns Err."
msgstr ""
"Funkcija SUMX2MY2() (SUM(X^2-Y^2)) vraća razliku kvadrata vrijednosti. Broj "
"vrijednosti u ova dva niza treba da je jednak. U suprotnom, funkcija će "
"vratiti grešku."

#: functions/statistical.xml:1382
msgid "SUMX2MY2(array1;array2)"
msgstr "SUMX2MY2(niz1;niz2)"

#: functions/statistical.xml:1383
msgid "SUMX2MY2(A1:A2;B1:B2) with A1=2, A2=5, B1=3 and B2=5, returns -5"
msgstr "SUMX2MY2(A1:A2;B1:B2) gdje je A1=2, A2=5, B1=3 i B2=5, vraća -5"

#: functions/statistical.xml:1395
msgid "Degrees of freedom for the t-distribution"
msgstr "Stepeni slobode za t-distribuciju"

#: functions/statistical.xml:1399
msgid "Mode (1 or 2)"
msgstr "Režim (1 ili 2)"

#: functions/statistical.xml:1403
msgid "The TDIST() function returns the t-distribution."
msgstr "Funkcija TDIST() vraća t-distribuciju."

#: functions/statistical.xml:1404
msgid ""
"Mode = 1 returns the one-tailed test, Mode = 2 returns the two-tailed test."
msgstr "Režim = 1 vraća jednorepi test, režim = 2 vraća dvorepi test."

#: functions/statistical.xml:1405
msgid "TDIST(number;degrees_freedom;mode)"
msgstr "TDIST(broj;st.slobode;režim)"

#: functions/statistical.xml:1406
msgid "TDIST(12;5;1) returns 0.000035"
msgstr "TDIST(12;5;1) vraća 0.000035"

#: functions/statistical.xml:1414
msgid "KnownY"
msgstr "PoznatY"

#: functions/statistical.xml:1418
